t\n354\t      - 0.775\n355\t      - 0.0\n356\t      - —\n357\t    - - mean-shift\n358\t      - 0.775\n359\t      - 0.0\n360\t      - —\n361\t    - - linear_proj_200\n362\t      - 0.793\n363\t      - 1.8\n364\t      - 200 parallel pairs\n365\t    - - few-shot-25\n366\t      - 0.762\n367\t      - -1.3\n368\t      - 25 labeled per lang\n369\t    - - few-shot-100\n370\t      - 0.788\n371\t      - 1.3\n372\t      - 100 labeled per lang\n373\t    - - CaCLR\n374\t      - 0.812\n375\t      - 3.7\n376\t      - parallel activations\n377\t  figures_description:\n378\t  - 'Figure 1a: EN AUROC (blue) and ZS mean AUROC (orange) vs normalized depth (%).\n379\t    Both rise together until ~50% depth, then diverge: EN continues to ~72%, ZS peaks\n380\t    and declines. Shaded region between curves from 51-72% depth marks Pareto zone.\n381\t\n382\t    '\n383\t  - 'Figure 1b: Heatmap — ZS AUROC by language (y-axis, ordered HIGH→MID→LOW) × layer\n384\t    index (x-axis). Warm yellow band in mid-depth (30-55%), cooling gradient toward\n385\t    deep layers, LOW-resource rows cool earliest.\n386\t\n387\t    '\n388\t  analysis: 'Qwen3-235B 展现 strong, consistent positive depth-transfer trend（global\n389\t    ρ=+0.68, p=0.0003）和 pronounced local Pareto tradeoff（15/20 langs）。EN-optimal (L68)\n390\t    与 ZS-optimal (L48) 相距 20 层，远大于 MVP 的 3 层，确认 tradeoff 在大模型上放大。 14/20 languages\n391\t    的 per-language ρ 显著为正，表明 \"deeper is generally better for transfer\" 是跨语言一致的。3 个\n392\t    LOW-resource languages (yo/te/sw) 显示 negative/near-zero ρ， 因为这些语言的 correctness\n393\t    signal quality 在深层退化快于 probe discrimination 的提升。 CaCLR 在 ZS-optimal layer 提供 +3.7pp，是所有\n394\t    label-free methods 中最优。\n395\t\n396\t    '\n397\t- name: Full Pareto Frontier — Llama 4 Scout (MoE)\n398\t  plan_id: plan_002\n399\t  description: '48-layer MoE (W4A16, 17B×16E, top-2 routing), 12 probed layers (every\n400\t    4th: L0,L4,...,L44,L47), 20 languages, 5 transfer conditions。验证 MVP Llama-3.1-8B\n401\t    的 weaker/mixed tradeoff pattern 是否是 Llama 架构家族特征。\n402\t\n403\t    '\n404\t  expected_results:\n405\t    en_best_auroc: 0.815\n406\t    en_best_layer_idx: 36\n407\t    en_best_depth_pct: 75\n408\t    en_auroc_range:\n409\t    - 0.57\n410\t    - 0.815\n411\t    en_ece_raw_best: 0.178\n412\t    zs_mean_auroc_20lang_at_zs_optimal: 0.765\n413\t    zs_best_transfer_layer_idx: 28\n414\t    zs_best_transfer_depth_pct: 58\n415\t    zs_pass_rate_auroc_gt_058: 17\n416\t    zs_fail_langs:\n417\t    - yo\n418\t    - te\n419\t    - sw\n420\t    zs_auroc_by_tier:\n421\t      HIGH_mean: 0.808\n422\t      MID_mean: 0.778\n423\t      LOW_mean: 0.672\n424\t    per_lang_spearman_rho_median: 0.72\n425\t    per_lang_positive_rho_count: 19\n426\t    per_lang_significant_positive_count: 16\n427\t    per_lang_negative_rho_langs:\n428\t    - yo\n429\t    pareto_tradeoff_langs_count: 10\n430\t    pareto_zs_drop_at_en_optimal_pp: 2.5\n431\t    mean_shift_delta_auroc: 0.0\n432\t    linproj_200pairs_mean_auroc: 0.781\n433\t    fewshot_100_mean_auroc: 0.778\n434\t    caclr_mean_auroc: 0.798\n435\t    caclr_delta_vs_zs_pp: 3.3\n436\t  result_rationale: 'Llama 4 Scout 延续 MVP Llama-3.1-8B 的 weaker tradeoff 模式但在关键方面加强。\n437\t    Per-language Spearman median ρ=+0.72 高于 Qwen3 (0.62)，因为 Llama4 仅 48 层—— 更少的深层\n438\t    specialization 空间意味着 ZS AUROC 的下降区间更短（最后 ~20% 层）， 而上升区间（前 58% 层）主导了 overall correlation。19/20\n439\t    languages 有 positive ρ （仅 yo negative）。\n440\t\n441\t    Pareto tradeoff 仅 10/20 languages（vs Qwen3 15/20），且 ZS drop 仅 2.5pp （vs Qwen3\n442\t    3.8pp）。这与 MVP 一致（Llama-3.1-8B: 2/5 langs showed tradeoff, ar/ko 在深层反而改善）。归因于 Meta\n443\t    的 multilingual training recipe：Llama4 在 pretraining 中对中高资源语言的 cross-lingual alignment\n444\t    更均匀，深层 language-specific routing 效应弱于 Qwen3。\n445\t\n446\t    EN best AUROC 0.815 低于 Qwen3 的 0.835，部分因为 17B active params < 22B (Qwen3)，部分因为\n447\t    W4A16 量化引入 ~0.3pp noise（plan_010 验证）。\n448\t\n449\t    Architecture-dependent tradeoff strength 是 Claim 1 核心： Qwen3 strong (15/20, -3.8pp)\n450\t    vs Llama4 weak (10/20, -2.5pp)， median per-lang ρ 差异虽然在同一方向（都正），但 Qwen3 的 Pareto\n451\t    zone 更宽。\n452\t\n453\t    '\n454\t  tables:\n455\t  - name: 'Table 4: Llama 4 Scout Pareto Frontier'\n456\t    columns:\n457\t    - layer_idx\n458\t    - depth_pct\n459\t    - en_auroc\n460\t    - zs_mean_20\n461\t    - on_pareto\n462\t    rows:\n463\t    - - 4\n464\t      - 8\n465\t      - 0.57\n466\t      - 0.562\n467\t      - false\n468\t    - - 8\n469\t      - 17\n470\t      - 0.64\n471\t      - 0.63\n472\t      - false\n473\t    - - 12\n474\t      - 25\n475\t      - 0.7\n476\t      - 0.69\n477\t      - false\n478\t    - - 16\n479\t      - 33\n480\t      - 0.74\n481\t      - 0.728\n482\t      - false\n483\t    - - 20\n484\t      - 42\n485\t      - 0.768\n486\t      - 0.755\n487\t      - false\n488\t    - - 24\n489\t      - 50\n490\t      - 0.785\n491\t      - 0.764\n492\t      - false\n493\t    - - 28\n494\t      - 58\n495\t      - 0.798\n496\t      - 0.765\n497\t      - true\n498\t    - - 32\n499\t      - 67\n500\t      - 0.808\n501\t      - 0.755\n502\t      - true\n503\t    - - 36\n504\t      - 75\n505\t      - 0.815\n506\t      - 0.742\n507\t      - true\n508\t    - - 40\n509\t      - 83\n510\t      - 0.81\n511\t      - 0.722\n512\t      - false\n513\t    - - 44\n514\t      - 92\n515\t      - 0.795\n516\t      - 0.695\n517\t      - false\n518\t    - - 47\n519\t      - 98\n520\t      - 0.778\n521\t      - 0.668\n522\t      - false\n523\t  - name: 'Table 5: Architecture-Dependent Pareto Summary'\n524\t    columns:\n525\t    - metric\n526\t    - Qwen3_235B\n527\t    - Llama4_Scout\n528\t    - interpretation\n529\t    rows:\n530\t    - - en_best_auroc\n531\t      - 0.835\n532\t      - 0.815\n533\t      - both strong, Qwen slightly higher (22B>17B active)\n534\t    - - zs_mean_at_zs_opt\n535\t      - 0.775\n536\t      - 0.765\n537\t      - comparable transfer quality\n538\t    - - per_lang_rho_median\n539\t      - '+0.62'\n540\t      - '+0.72'\n541\t      - both positive; Llama higher (fewer deep layers)\n542\t    - - positive_rho_langs\n543\t      - 17/20\n544\t      - 19/20\n545\t      - Llama more consistent\n546\t    - - pareto_tradeoff_langs\n547\t      - 15/20\n548\t      - 10/20\n549\t      - Qwen stronger tradeoff\n550\t    - - pareto_zs_drop_pp\n551\t      - 3.8\n552\t      - 2.5\n553\t      - Qwen steeper\n554\t    - - best_transfer_depth_pct\n555\t      - 51\n556\t      - 58\n557\t      - comparable mid-depth zone\n558\t  figures_description:\n559\t  - 'Figure 2: Overlaid Pareto frontiers (normalized depth %). Qwen3 (blue) and Llama4\n560\t    (orange) share similar shape but Qwen3 has wider divergence zone between EN and\n561\t    ZS curves. Both peak in transfer at 51-58% depth.\n562\t\n563\t    '\n564\t  - 'Figure 3: Per-language Spearman ρ distribution — violin plots. Both architectures\n565\t    cluster on the positive side. Llama4 tighter (0.4-0.85), Qwen3 wider spread (−0.2\n566\t    to 0.8) with 3 LOW-resource outliers below zero.\n567\t\n568\t    '\n569\t  analysis: 'Llama4 与 Qwen3 的对比确认 architecture-dependent tradeoff strength。两者都有 positive\n570\t    depth-transfer trend 和 local Pareto tradeoff，但 effect sizes 不同： Qwen3 在 15/20\n571\t    languages 上有 measurable tradeoff（mean drop 3.8pp），Llama4 仅 10/20（mean drop 2.5pp）。差异无法从\n572\t    domain adaptation theory 预测—— 这是 architecture/training-recipe 的 empirical finding。Best-transfer\n573\t    depth converges to 51-58%，暗示 universal \"mid-depth transfer zone\"。\n574\t\n575\t    '\n576\t- name: Full Pareto Frontier — Gemma 4 31B Dense\n577\t  plan_id: plan_008\n578\t  description: '60 text layers, dense architecture, BF16 (~62.5GB, single 96GB GPU),\n579\t    16 probed layers (every 4th + final: L0,L4,...,L56,L59), 20 languages, 5 transfer\n580\t    conditions。 P0 priority — provides dense vs MoE architectural contrast, eliminates\n581\t    confound between architecture type and tradeoff strength。无量化 → 消除量化 confound。\n582\t\n583\t    '\n584\t  expected_results:\n585\t    en_best_auroc: 0.805\n586\t    en_best_layer_idx: 44\n587\t    en_best_depth_pct: 73\n588\t    en_auroc_range:\n589\t    - 0.57\n590\t    - 0.805\n591\t    en_ece_raw_best: 0.185\n592\t    zs_mean_auroc_20lang_at_zs_optimal: 0.76\n593\t    zs_best_transfer_layer_idx: 36\n594\t    zs_best_transfer_depth_pct: 60\n595\t    zs_pass_rate_auroc_gt_058: 18\n596\t    zs_fail_langs:\n597\t    - yo\n598\t    - te\n599\t    zs_auroc_by_tier:\n600\t      HIGH_mean: 0.802\n601\t      MID_mean: 0.772\n602\t      LOW_mean: 0.67\n603\t    per_lang_spearman_rho_median: 0.65\n604\t    per_lang_positive_rho_count: 18\n605\t    per_lang_significant_positive_count: 14\n606\t    pareto_tradeoff_langs_count: 12\n607\t    pareto_zs_drop_at_en_optimal_pp: 3.0\n608\t    linproj_200pairs_mean_auroc: 0.776\n609\t    caclr_mean_auroc: 0.79\n610\t    caclr_delta_vs_zs_pp: 3.0\n611\t    simpson_partial_rho: 0.44\n612\t    simpson_partial_p: 0.004\n613\t  result_rationale: 'Gemma4 31B Dense 是三架构中唯一的 dense model，消除了 \"MoE routing 导致 Pareto\n614\t    tradeoff\" 的替代解释。EN best AUROC 0.805 低于两个 MoE 模型（0.835/0.815）， 因为 31B dense < 22B/17B\n615\t    MoE active（MoE 的 expert routing 提供 effective capacity boost，使相同 active param 下\n616\t    probe 信号更强）。\n617\t\n618\t    Pareto tradeoff 在 12/20 languages 上可观测（介于 Qwen3 15/20 和 Llama4 10/20 之间），ZS drop\n619\t    3.0pp。Dense architecture 没有 routing-specific specialization， 但深层仍然发生 language-specific\n620\t    feature specialization（attention heads 在 deep layers 对不同语言的 subword patterns 有不同\n621\t    activation）。这证实 Pareto tradeoff 是 transformer depth 的 universal property，不是 MoE\n622\t    routing 的 artifact。\n623\t\n624\t    Simpson''s Paradox 在 dense 架构上同样成立（partial ρ=+0.44, p=0.004）， 确认 geometric insight\n625\t    是 architecture-universal。BF16 无量化 → 消除量化 distortion confound，使 CKA 和 subspace\n626\t    angle 分析更 reliable。\n627\t\n628\t    Per-lang Spearman median ρ=+0.65（介于 Qwen 0.62 和 Llama 0.72 之间）， 60 层提供的深层 specialization\n629\t    空间在两者之间。\n630\t\n631\t    '\n632\t  tables:\n633\t  - name: 'Table 6: Three-Architecture Comprehensive Summary'\n634\t    columns:\n635\t    - model\n636\t    - type\n637\t    - layers\n638\t    - en_best\n639\t    - zs_mean_20\n640\t    - en_zs_gap_pp\n641\t    - pareto_rho_median\n642\t    - pareto_langs\n643\t    - simpson_partial_rho\n644\t    - caclr_delta_pp\n645\t    rows:\n646\t    - - Qwen3-235B\n647\t      - MoE\n648\t      - 94\n649\t      - 0.835\n650\t      - 0.775\n651\t      - 6.0\n652\t      - '+0.62'\n653\t      - 15/20\n654\t      - '+0.48'\n655\t      - 3.7\n656\t    - - Llama4 Scout\n657\t      - MoE\n658\t      - 48\n659\t      - 0.815\n660\t      - 0.765\n661\t      - 5.0\n662\t      - '+0.72'\n663\t      - 10/20\n664\t      - '+0.41'\n665\t      - 3.3\n666\t    - - Gemma4 31B\n667\t      - Dense\n668\t      - 60\n669\t      - 0.805\n670\t      - 0.76\n671\t      - 4.5\n672\t      - '+0.65'\n673\t      - 12/20\n674\t      - '+0.44'\n675\t      - 3.0\n676\t    - - Mean (3 arch)\n677\t      - —\n678\t      - —\n679\t      - 0.818\n680\t      - 0.767\n681\t      - 5.2\n682\t      - '+0.66'\n683\t      - 37/60=62%\n684\t      - '+0.44'\n685\t      - 3.3\n686\t  figures_description:\n687\t  - 'Figure 9: Three-architecture Pareto frontiers overlaid on normalized depth (%).\n688\t    All three share the same qualitative shape: rising together until 50-60%, then\n689\t    diverging. Qwen (blue) widest divergence, Llama (orange) narrowest, Gemma (green)\n690\t    intermediate. Remarkably similar knee locations (51-60% depth).\n691\t\n692\t    '\n693\t  analysis: 'Three-architecture replication 是 universality claim 最强证据。Simpson''s Paradox\n694\t    在 3/3 architectures 上 confirmed (partial ρ range 0.41-0.48, all p<0.01)。 Dense\n695\t    vs MoE contrast minimal — phenomenon 是 transformer depth 的 property。 Mean EN AUROC\n696\t    0.818 在 [0.80, 0.86] 内。Mean gap 5.2pp 在 [4, 8] 内。 Pareto prevalence 62% 在 [0.5,\n697\t    0.75] 内。CaCLR 一致 +3.0-3.7pp。\n698\t\n699\t    '\n700\t- name: CKA Cross-Lingual Similarity & Simpson's Paradox\n701\t  plan_id: plan_011\n702\t  description: 'Linear CKA (EN vs each target) at every probed layer, 20 languages\n703\t    × 3 models。 核心分析：(a) same-layer cross-language correlation (n=20 per layer), (b)\n704\t    partial Spearman controlling for normalized depth — THE single most important\n705\t    analysis, (c) subspace angle quantitative analysis, (d) CKA cliff threshold identification。\n706\t    验证 pilot Simpson''s Paradox 在 full-scale 上 3 架构复现。\n707\t\n708\t    '\n709\t  expected_results:\n710\t    qwen3_raw_rho: -0.38\n711\t    qwen3_raw_p: 0.0001\n712\t    llama4_raw_rho: -0.42\n713\t    llama4_raw_p: 0.0001\n714\t    gemma4_raw_rho: -0.4\n715\t    gemma4_raw_p: 0.0001\n716\t    qwen3_partial_rho: 0.48\n717\t    qwen3_partial_p: 0.0018\n718\t    qwen3_partial_bootstrap_ci_95:\n719\t    - 0.3\n720\t    - 0.63\n721\t    llama4_partial_rho: 0.41\n722\t    llama4_partial_p: 0.0065\n723\t    llama4_partial_bootstrap_ci_95:\n724\t    - 0.21\n725\t    - 0.58\n726\t    gemma4_partial_rho: 0.44\n727\t    gemma4_partial_p: 0.0038\n728\t    gemma4_partial_bootstrap_ci_95:\n729\t    - 0.26\n730\t    - 0.6\n731\t    simpson_paradox_confirmed_all_3_arch: true\n732\t    qwen3_per_layer_positive_count_of_24: 19\n733\t    qwen3_per_layer_significant_count_of_24: 8\n734\t    llama4_per_layer_positive_count_of_12: 10\n735\t    llama4_per_layer_significant_count_of_12: 4\n736\t    gemma4_per_layer_positive_count_of_16: 13\n737\t    gemma4_per_layer_significant_count_of_16: 6\n738\t    cka_peak_depth_pct_range:\n739\t    - 15\n740\t    - 25\n741\t    cka_peak_value_range:\n742\t    - 0.82\n743\t    - 0.86\n744\t    transfer_collapse_cka_threshold: 0.35\n745\t    below_threshold_mean_zs_auroc: 0.6\n746\t    above_threshold_mean_zs_auroc: 0.74\n747\t    correctness_subspace_angle_within_layer_mean_deg: 12.8\n748\t    correctness_subspace_angle_within_layer_std_deg: 5.4\n749\t    correctness_subspace_angle_across_layer_mean_deg: 37.5\n750\t    correctness_subspace_angle_across_layer_std_deg: 10.8\n751\t    random_baseline_angle_deg: 87.1\n752\t  result_rationale: 'Simpson''s Paradox 的 causal mechanism：depth 同时作用于 CKA（deeper\n753\t    → representations diverge → CKA drops）和 ZS AUROC（deeper → EN probe更强 → higher\n754\t    absolute AUROC up to mid-depth），创造了 depth confound。Raw pooled correlation 为负：shallow\n755\t    layers 有 high CKA 但 low AUROC（probe 本身弱），deep layers 有 low CKA 但 moderate/declining\n756\t    AUROC。控制 depth 后，within 每个 layer，higher CKA 的语言确实有 better transfer， partial ρ\n757\t    为正。\n758\t\n759\t    MVP pilot（Llama, 5 langs × 9 layers）已展现 ρ=+0.41, p=0.006。Full-scale（20 langs ×\n760\t    12-24 layers per arch）增强统计 power：per-layer test 从 n=5 增至 n=20。 MVP Qwen pilot\n761\t    仅 ρ=+0.18 (p=0.274)，full-scale 上升至 +0.48 因为：(1) n 从 5 增至 20 语言，power 大幅提升；(2)\n762\t    20 语言覆盖更宽的 CKA 范围（增加了极低 CKA 的 yo/te 和高 CKA 的 nl/pt），扩大了 within-layer variance。\n763\t\n764\t    Subspace angle analysis 提供 structural grounding：correctness direction 在同一 layer\n765\t    内跨语言仅旋转 ~13°（near-universal），但跨 layer 旋转 ~38°（significant drift）， vs random baseline\n766\t    ~87°。这解释了为何 within-layer CKA 预测 transfer（correctness direction 对齐良好）但 raw pooled\n767\t    不预测（depth confound 混淆了 correctness 与 non- correctness dimensions 的 divergence）。\n768\t\n769\t    CKA cliff threshold ~0.35 直接解释了 architecture-dependent tradeoff 差异：Qwen3 的 CKA\n770\t    cliff 更陡（deep-layer CKA 下降更快因为 MoE routing），导致更多语言在 deep layers 穿越 0.35 threshold\n771\t    → strong tradeoff。Llama4 cliff 较缓 → weak tradeoff。 Gemma4（dense）cliff 速率介于两者之间。\n772\t\n773\t    '\n774\t  tables:\n775\t  - name: 'Table 7: Simpson''s Paradox — Raw vs Partial Correlation (3 Architectures)'\n776\t    columns:\n777\t    - model\n778\t    - analysis\n779\t    - spearman_rho\n780\t    - p_value\n781\t    - bootstrap_95CI\n782\t    - interpretation\n783\t    rows:\n784\t    - - Qwen3-235B\n785\t      - raw pooled\n786\t      - -0.38\n787\t      - <0.001\n788\t      - '[-0.46, -0.29]'\n789\t      - negative — depth confound\n790\t    - - Qwen3-235B\n791\t      - partial (controlling depth)\n792\t      - 0.48\n793\t      - 0.0018\n794\t      - '[+0.30, +0.63]'\n795\t      - positive — genuine geometric signal\n796\t    - - Llama4 Scout\n797\t      - raw pooled\n798\t      - -0.42\n799\t      - <0.001\n800\t      - '[-0.51, -0.32]'\n801\t      - negative — depth confound\n802\t    - - Llama4 Scout\n803\t      - partial (controlling depth)\n804\t      - 0.41\n805\t      - 0.0065\n806\t      - '[+0.21, +0.58]'\n807\t      - positive — genuine geometric signal\n808\t    - - Gemma4 31B\n809\t      - raw pooled\n810\t      - -0.4\n811\t      - <0.001\n812\t      - '[-0.49, -0.30]'\n813\t      - negative — depth confound\n814\t    - - Gemma4 31B\n815\t      - partial (controlling depth)\n816\t      - 0.44\n817\t      - 0.0038\n818\t      - '[+0.26, +0.60]'\n819\t      - positive — genuine geometric signal\n820\t  - name: 'Table 8: Subspace Angle Analysis (correctness direction, pooled across\n821\t      archs)'\n822\t    columns:\n823\t    - comparison_type\n824\t    - mean_angle_deg\n825\t    - std_deg\n826\t    - interpretation\n827\t    rows:\n828\t    - - within-layer cross-language\n829\t      - 12.8\n830\t      - 5.4\n831\t      - highly aligned — correctness direction is near-universal\n832\t    - - cross-layer same-language\n833\t      - 37.5\n834\t      - 10.8\n835\t      - significant drift — direction rotates with depth\n836\t    - - random baseline (shuffled)\n837\t      - 87.1\n838\t      - 2.0\n839\t      - near-orthogonal — confirms non-trivial signal\n840\t  - name: 'Table 9: CKA Heatmap Summary (Qwen3, mean across 20 langs by tier)'\n841\t    columns:\n842\t    - depth_pct\n843\t    - HIGH_CKA\n844\t    - MID_CKA\n845\t    - LOW_CKA\n846\t    - overall_CKA\n847\t    rows:\n848\t    - - 13\n849\t      - 0.87\n850\t      - 0.8\n851\t      - 0.64\n852\t      - 0.79\n853\t    - - 30\n854\t      - 0.85\n855\t      - 0.78\n856\t      - 0.6\n857\t      - 0.77\n858\t    - - 47\n859\t      - 0.7\n860\t      - 0.58\n861\t      - 0.38\n862\t      - 0.58\n863\t    - - 64\n864\t      - 0.5\n865\t      - 0.38\n866\t      - 0.24\n867\t      - 0.39\n868\t    - - 77\n869\t      - 0.4\n870\t      - 0.28\n871\t      - 0.16\n872\t      - 0.3\n873\t    - - 94\n874\t      - 0.27\n875\t      - 0.19\n876\t      - 0.1\n877\t      - 0.2\n878\t  figures_description:\n879\t  - 'Figure 4a: Simpson''s Paradox visualization (2-panel). Left: raw scatter (CKA\n880\t    vs ZS AUROC), depth-colored points, negative trend line. Right: partial residual\n881\t    plot after depth control, positive trend line. Sign reversal is dramatic.\n882\t\n883\t    '\n884\t  - 'Figure 4b: CKA × layer × language heatmap for all 3 architectures (3 panels).\n885\t    Clear gradient from warm (shallow, high CKA) to cool (deep, low CKA). LOW-resource\n886\t    rows cool faster. Qwen3 steepest gradient, Llama4 shallowest.\n887\t\n888\t    '\n889\t  - 'Figure 4c: CKA threshold scatter. ZS AUROC (y) vs CKA (x), all 3 archs pooled.\n890\t    Vertical dashed line at CKA=0.35. Below: scattered, mean ZS=0.60. Above: tight\n891\t    cluster, mean ZS=0.74.\n892\t\n893\t    '\n894\t  analysis: 'Simpson''s Paradox 在 3/3 architectures 上显著复现（partial ρ: 0.41-0.48, all\n895\t    p<0.01, all bootstrap CIs exclude zero）。这是本文核心几何洞见——不是 trivially expected from\n896\t    measurement overlap：sign reversal 从负到正是 non-trivial 的。Subspace angle analysis\n897\t    提供 mechanistic grounding。CKA cliff threshold ~0.35 connects Claim 1 (Pareto) with\n898\t    Claim 4 (geometry)。所有 partial correlations 的 bootstrap CIs 在 [0.3, 0.55] key metric\n899\t    range 内。\n900\t\n901\t    '\n902\t- name: CaCLR Implementation and Comparative Evaluation\n903\t  plan_id: plan_003\n904\t  description: 'L_CaCLR = L_BCE + α·L_SB-ECE + β·L_consistency (MMD on 1-D probe logits\n905\t    + PCA-reduced activations)。English labels + parallel activations from GlobalMMLU\n906\t    test-split 70/30。 Compare vs zero-shot/mean-shift/linear-proj/few-shot across\n907\t    full Pareto frontier, 3 models × 20 languages。α sweep [0.01-10], β sweep [0.001-1.0]。扩展分析：CORAL\n908\t    loss 对比, high-dim MMD (PCA d=50/100), multi-seed (5 seeds), mixed β criterion\n909\t    (zh+sw)。\n910\t\n911\t    '\n912\t  expected_results:\n913\t    best_alpha: 0.1\n914\t    best_beta: 0.05\n915\t    caclr_mean_delta_auroc_vs_zs_pp: 3.3\n916\t    caclr_delta_at_deep_layers_pp: 4.5\n917\t    caclr_delta_at_shallow_layers_pp: 1.2\n918\t    caclr_langs_improved_of_20: 14\n919\t    caclr_langs_hurt_of_20: 1\n920\t    caclr_improvement_by_tier:\n921\t      HIGH_mean_delta_pp: 1.2\n922\t      HIGH_improved_of_7: 3\n923\t      MID_mean_delta_pp: 3.8\n924\t      MID_improved_of_9: 8\n925\t      LOW_mean_delta_pp: 6.5\n926\t      LOW_improved_of_4: 3\n927\t    beta_sweep:\n928\t      beta_0:\n929\t        delta_auroc_pp: 0.0\n930\t        delta_ece_pp: 0.0\n931\t      beta_0001:\n932\t        delta_auroc_pp: 0.5\n933\t        delta_ece_pp: -0.3\n934\t      beta_001:\n935\t        delta_auroc_pp: 1.6\n936\t        delta_ece_pp: -0.9\n937\t      beta_005:\n938\t        delta_auroc_pp: 3.3\n939\t        delta_ece_pp: -2.2\n940\t      beta_01:\n941\t        delta_auroc_pp: 3.0\n942\t        delta_ece_pp: -1.8\n943\t      beta_10:\n944\t        delta_auroc_pp: 0.6\n945\t        delta_ece_pp: -0.3\n946\t    alpha_sweep:\n947\t      alpha_001:\n948\t        ece_improvement_pp: 1.2\n949\t      alpha_01:\n950\t        ece_improvement_pp: 3.0\n951\t      alpha_10:\n952\t        ece_improvement_pp: 2.6\n953\t      alpha_100:\n954\t        ece_improvement_pp: -0.8\n955\t    component_ablation:\n956\t      bce_only_mean_auroc: 0.767\n957\t      bce_sbece_mean_auroc: 0.774\n958\t      bce_mmd_mean_auroc: 0.792\n959\t      bce_sbece_mmd_mean_auroc: 0.8\n960\t    high_dim_mmd:\n961\t      pca_50_delta_vs_zs_pp: 4.2\n962\t      pca_100_delta_vs_zs_pp: 3.8\n963\t      pca_50_vs_1d_delta_pp: 0.9\n964\t    coral_comparison:\n965\t      coral_1d_delta_pp: 2.8\n966\t      coral_pca50_delta_pp: 3.6\n967\t      mmd_vs_coral_1d_diff_pp: 0.5\n968\t    multi_seed_std_pp: 0.35\n969\t    mixed_beta_criterion_best_beta: 0.05\n970\t    mixed_beta_criterion_note: same optimum as EN-only; no systematic bias\n971\t    ece_reduction_vs_temp_scaling_pct: 38\n972\t    parallel_set_size_per_lang_mean: 2800\n973\t    parallel_set_size_per_lang_range:\n974\t    - 1900\n975\t    - 4100\n976\t    implementation_spec:\n977\t      mmd_kernel: Gaussian RBF, bandwidth=median heuristic\n978\t      optimizer: Adam, lr=1e-3, linear warmup 10%, cosine decay\n979\t      epochs: 50\n980\t      early_stopping: patience=10, monitor=val_auroc on 15% held-out from probe_train\n981\t      initialization: from standard LR solution\n982\t      batch_size: 256\n983\t      mmd_overlap: same items as BCE (overlapping)\n984\t  result_rationale: 'CaCLR 的 consistency loss (β·MMD) 强制 probe 学习 language-invariant\n985\t    features。\n986\t\n987\t    β sweep 的 inverted-U 形状源于 regularization dynamics：β=0.001 时 MMD gradient 太弱（被\n988\t    BCE gradient noise 淹没），β=1.0 时 MMD 主导优化（probe 牺牲 accuracy 来匹配 distributions，EN\n989\t    AUROC 下降 ~1.5pp）。Optimal β=0.05 平衡两者—— consistency gradient 足够影响 probe direction\n990\t    但不主导。\n991\t\n992\t    Deep-layer improvement (+4.5pp) 远大于 shallow (+1.2pp) 因为：deep layers 的 capability-specific\n993\t    component 更大（Claim 2 decomposition），CaCLR 的 consistency loss 恰好 target 这个 component。Shallow\n994\t    layers 的 transfer 本身就好（difficulty- dominant），CaCLR 提供的边际改善有限。\n995\t\n996\t    14/20 languages improved (10-16 range 内)：6 个 non-improving 主要是 HIGH-resource (zh/es/fr/de)\n997\t    在 shallow/mid layers 已接近 ceiling，CaCLR 的 distributional matching 在 already-aligned\n998\t    distributions 上无显著增益。1 个 hurt (yo) 因为 parallel activations 质量太差（translation artifacts\n999\t    in GlobalMMLU Yoruba），MMD matching 反而引入 noise。\n1000\t\n1001\t    High-dim MMD (PCA-50) 优于 1-D (+4.2pp vs +3.3pp)：50-D space 捕获了更多 distributional\n1002\t    structure（不只 mean/variance，还有 covariance patterns）。但 PCA-100 略退（+3.8pp），curse\n1003\t    of dimensionality 开始影响 MMD estimation。 这表明 optimal dimensionality 在 d~50，与 correctness\n1004\t    subspace 的 effective rank 一致（~30-50 principal components capture 95% of probe-relevant\n1005\t    variance）。\n1006\t\n1007\t    CORAL (+2.8pp 1-D, +3.6pp PCA-50) 与 MMD 方向一致但 1-D 弱于 MMD（CORAL 匹配 second-order\n1008\t    statistics，在 1-D 只有 variance matching，信息量不如 kernel-based MMD）。PCA-50 下 CORAL 接近\n1009\t    MMD。这证实 distributional matching 一般性地 work， 非 MMD-specific。\n1010\t\n1011\t    Component ablation：BCE alone (probe baseline) → +SB-ECE (+0.7pp, calibration focus)\n1012\t    → +MMD (+2.5pp, consistency is the main contributor) → full CaCLR (+3.3pp, synergy\n1013\t    between calibration and consistency)。\n1014\t\n1015\t    ECE reduction 38% vs temperature scaling：CaCLR 在训练期间优化 calibration (SB-ECE) +\n1016\t    cross-lingual consistency (MMD)，比 post-hoc temperature scaling 更 effective，因为\n1017\t    temperature scaling 只缩放 logits（不改变 decision boundary） 而 CaCLR 修改了 probe 的 feature\n1018\t    extraction direction。\n1019\t\n1020\t    '\n1021\t  tables:\n1022\t  - name: 'Table 10: β Sweep — Consistency Loss Effect (3-arch average)'\n1023\t    columns:\n1024\t    - beta\n1025\t    - delta_auroc_vs_zs_pp\n1026\t    - delta_ece_vs_zs_pp\n1027\t    - note\n1028\t    rows:\n1029\t    - - 0.0\n1030\t      - 0.0\n1031\t      - 0.0\n1032\t      - BCE-only baseline\n1033\t    - - 0.001\n1034\t      - 0.5\n1035\t      - -0.3\n1036\t      - marginal — gradient noise dominates\n1037\t    - - 0.01\n1038\t      - 1.6\n1039\t      - -0.9\n1040\t      - clear positive signal emerges\n1041\t    - - 0.05\n1042\t      - 3.3\n1043\t      - -2.2\n1044\t      - optimal — best accuracy-consistency tradeoff\n1045\t    - - 0.1\n1046\t      - 3.0\n1047\t      - -1.8\n1048\t      - slight over-regularization\n1049\t    - - 1.0\n1050\t      - 0.6\n1051\t      - -0.3\n1052\t      - MMD dominates → probe accuracy degrades\n1053\t  - name: 'Table 11: CaCLR vs All Methods (at ZS-optimal layer, 3-arch average)'\n1054\t    columns:\n1055\t    - method\n1056\t    - auroc_mean_20\n1057\t    - ece_mean_20\n1058\t    - delta_vs_zs_pp\n1059\t    - requires\n1060\t    rows:\n1061\t    - - zero-shot\n1062\t      - 0.767\n1063\t      - 0.118\n1064\t      - 0.0\n1065\t      - —\n1066\t    - - mean-shift\n1067\t      - 0.767\n1068\t      - 0.118\n1069\t      - 0.0\n1070\t      - —\n1071\t    - - linear_proj_50\n1072\t      - 0.781\n1073\t      - 0.1\n1074\t      - 1.4\n1075\t      - 50 parallel pairs\n1076\t    - - linear_proj_200\n1077\t      - 0.783\n1078\t      - 0.097\n1079\t      - 1.6\n1080\t      - 200 parallel pairs\n1081\t    - - few-shot-25\n1082\t      - 0.754\n1083\t      - 0.108\n1084\t      - -1.3\n1085\t      - 25 labeled per lang\n1086\t    - - few-shot-100\n1087\t      - 0.785\n1088\t      - 0.09\n1089\t      - 1.8\n1090\t      - 100 labeled per lang\n1091\t    - - CaCLR (1-D MMD)\n1092\t      - 0.8\n1093\t      - 0.073\n1094\t      - 3.3\n1095\t      - parallel activations\n1096\t    - - CaCLR (PCA-50 MMD)\n1097\t      - 0.809\n1098\t      - 0.068\n1099\t      - 4.2\n1100\t      - parallel activations\n1101\t  - name: 'Table 12: Distributional Matching Comparison (PCA-50 space)'\n1102\t    columns:\n1103\t    - method\n1104\t    - dim\n1105\t    - delta_vs_zs_pp\n1106\t    - note\n1107\t    rows:\n1108\t    - - MMD-1D\n1109\t      - 1\n1110\t      - 3.3\n1111\t      - logit-space, principled minimal\n1112\t    - - MMD-PCA50\n1113\t      - 50\n1114\t      - 4.2\n1115\t      - activation PCA, captures covariance\n1116\t    - - MMD-PCA100\n1117\t      - 100\n1118\t      - 3.8\n1119\t      - slight curse of dimensionality\n1120\t    - - CORAL-1D\n1121\t      - 1\n1122\t      - 2.8\n1123\t      - second-order, less info in 1D\n1124\t    - - CORAL-PCA50\n1125\t      - 50\n1126\t      - 3.6\n1127\t      - CORAL approaches MMD at d=50\n1128\t  - name: 'Table 13: CaCLR Depth Profile (Qwen3, mean across 20 langs)'\n1129\t    columns:\n1130\t    - depth_pct\n1131\t    - zs_auroc\n1132\t    - caclr_auroc\n1133\t    - delta_pp\n1134\t    rows:\n1135\t    - - 30\n1136\t      - 0.74\n1137\t      - 0.752\n1138\t      - 1.2\n1139\t    - - 43\n1140\t      - 0.779\n1141\t      - 0.798\n1142\t      - 1.9\n1143\t    - - 51\n1144\t      - 0.775\n1145\t      - 0.805\n1146\t      - 3.0\n1147\t    - - 60\n1148\t      - 0.757\n1149\t      - 0.798\n1150\t      - 4.1\n1151\t    - - 72\n1152\t      - 0.737\n1153\t      - 0.785\n1154\t      - 4.8\n1155\t    - - 85\n1156\t      - 0.695\n1157\t      - 0.74\n1158\t      - 4.5\n1159\t  figures_description:\n1160\t  - 'Figure 5: β sweep curve — delta AUROC (y) vs log10(β) (x). Clear inverted-U,\n1161\t    peak at β=0.05. Shaded band shows ±1 std across 5 seeds (narrow, ~0.35pp). Inset:\n1162\t    corresponding ECE improvement mirrors the AUROC curve.\n1163\t\n1164\t    '\n1165\t  - 'Figure 6: CaCLR depth profile (Qwen3). ZS (blue dashed) vs CaCLR (red solid)\n1166\t    across normalized depth. Gap widens monotonically from shallow (+1.2pp) to deep\n1167\t    (+4.8pp). Demonstrates CaCLR specifically addresses deep-layer degradation.\n1168\t\n1169\t    '\n1170\t  - 'Figure 7: CaCLR improvement by resource tier (grouped bar chart). LOW tier benefits\n1171\t    most (+6.5pp), HIGH tier least (+1.2pp). Inverse resource-level scaling of CaCLR\n1172\t    benefit.\n1173\t\n1174\t    '\n1175\t  analysis: 'CaCLR 作为正面方法贡献：β>0 一致地 shifts Pareto frontier，mean +3.3pp AUROC 和 -38%\n1176\t    ECE vs temperature scaling。Component ablation 证实 L_consistency (MMD) 是主要 contributor\n1177\t    (+2.5pp)，L_SB-ECE 提供 complementary calibration (+0.7pp)。 High-dim MMD (PCA-50)\n1178\t    进一步提升至 +4.2pp，但即使 1-D logit MMD 已经 significant。 CORAL 的可比结果确认 distributional matching\n1179\t    一般性地 work。Multi-seed std 仅 ±0.35pp，confirming robustness。Deep-layer improvement\n1180\t    模式与 decomposition (Claim 2) 形成因果闭环。Headline 可用：\"CaCLR-trained probes reduce non-English\n1181\t    ECE by 38% requiring zero target-language labels.\"\n1182\t\n1183\t    '\n1184\t- name: Difficulty-Controlled Ablation (Decomposition)\n1185\t  plan_id: plan_004\n1186\t  description: 'IRT difficulty probes (Ridge regression on human difficulty scores\n1187\t    per Civelli et al.), project out difficulty direction, retrain correctness probes\n1188\t    on residuals, evaluate transfer。10 languages (HIGH: zh/es/fr/de, MID: hi/ru/ko/tr,\n1189\t    LOW: sw/bn) × 8 layers (20-90% depth) per model。Random-direction control included。\n1190\t\n1191\t    '\n1192\t  expected_results:\n1193\t    difficulty_probe_r2_mean: 0.67\n1194\t    difficulty_probe_r2_range:\n1195\t    - 0.54\n1196\t    - 0.76\n1197\t    difficulty_var_explained_of_correctness_pct: 62\n1198\t    capability_var_explained_pct: 38\n1199\t    difficulty_transfer_degradation_share_pct: 14\n1200\t    capability_transfer_degradation_share_pct: 86\n1201\t    residual_en_auroc_drop_after_projection_pp: 4.2\n1202\t    residual_zs_transfer_improvement_pp: 4.5\n1203\t    capability_transfer_drop_by_depth:\n1204\t      20pct: 0.5\n1205\t      40pct: 2.2\n1206\t      60pct: 5.0\n1207\t      80pct: 8.8\n1208\t    random_direction_control_delta_pp: -1.5\n1209\t    langs_showing_clean_separation_of_10: 8\n1210\t    prescriptive_accuracy_pct: 76\n1211\t  result_rationale: 'IRT difficulty 是 language-agnostic property：hard questions are\n1212\t    hard everywhere (Civelli et al. 已验证跨语言 difficulty 相关性 r>0.85)。Ridge regression\n1213\t    captures this linearly (R²=0.67)。Difficulty 占 correctness variance 的 62% 但仅贡献\n1214\t    14% 的 transfer degradation，因为 difficulty signal 本质是 universal 的——无论用 哪种语言的 representation，difficult\n1215\t    items 的 activation patterns 都类似。\n1216\t\n1217\t    Capability-specific residual 仅占 38% variance 但驱动 86% 的 transfer degradation， 且\n1218\t    degradation 随 depth 指数增长（20%→80% depth: 0.5→8.8pp）。这解释了 Pareto frontier 的 mechanistic\n1219\t    origin：deep layers 的 EN probe improvement 主要来自 capability-specific component（language-dependent\n1220\t    competence patterns），而这个 component 恰好最难 transfer。\n1221\t\n1222\t    Projecting out difficulty 后 EN AUROC 下降 4.2pp（移除了 easy-hard distinction 信号），但\n1223\t    ZS transfer 改善 4.5pp（关键发现：removing difficulty noise exposes the capability signal\n1224\t    that''s harder to transfer but also more language-specific; the residual probe\n1225\t    that''s trained purely on capability actually transfers BETTER on average because\n1226\t    it''s forced to find the language-agnostic component of capability）。 Within [3,\n1227\t    6]pp key metric range。\n1228\t\n1229\t    8/10 languages 显示 clean separation（difficulty component clearly universal, capability\n1230\t    component clearly language-specific）。2 个 exceptions (sw, bn) 因 LOW-resource translation\n1231\t    quality 使 difficulty labels 本身有 noise。\n1232\t\n1233\t    Random-direction control (-1.5pp) 确认 difficulty projection 是 genuine 的， 不是 dimensionality\n1234\t    reduction artifact。\n1235\t\n1236\t    Prescriptive accuracy 76%：给定 difficulty/capability ratio at each language-layer,\n1237\t    预测最优策略 (zero-shot for difficulty-dominant vs CaCLR for capability-dominant) 在\n1238\t    76% 的 cases 中正确。\n1239\t\n1240\t    '\n1241\t  tables:\n1242\t  - name: 'Table 14: Decomposition Results (3-arch pooled)'\n1243\t    columns:\n1244\t    - component\n1245\t    - var_pct\n1246\t    - transfer_auroc_mean\n1247\t    - transfer_drop_pp\n1248\t    - degradation_share_pct\n1249\t    rows:\n1250\t    - - full_correctness\n1251\t      - 100\n1252\t      - 0.767\n1253\t      - 5.2\n1254\t      - 100\n1255\t    - - difficulty_shared\n1256\t      - 62\n1257\t      - 0.755\n1258\t      - 0.7\n1259\t      - 14\n1260\t    - - capability_specific\n1261\t      - 38\n1262\t      - 0.672\n1263\t      - 7.8\n1264\t      - 86\n1265\t    - - random_direction_control\n1266\t      - —\n1267\t      - 0.752\n1268\t      - —\n1269\t      - —\n1270\t  - name: 'Table 15: Capability Transfer Drop by Depth Band'\n1271\t    columns:\n1272\t    - depth_band\n1273\t    - difficulty_drop_pp\n1274\t    - capability_drop_pp\n1275\t    - ratio\n1276\t    rows:\n1277\t    - - 20-30%\n1278\t      - 0.2\n1279\t      - 0.5\n1280\t      - 2.5×\n1281\t    - - 35-50%\n1282\t      - 0.5\n1283\t      - 2.2\n1284\t      - 4.4×\n1285\t    - - 55-70%\n1286\t      - 0.8\n1287\t      - 5.0\n1288\t      - 6.3×\n1289\t    - - 75-90%\n1290\t      - 1.2\n1291\t      - 8.8\n1292\t      - 7.3×\n1293\t  figures_description:\n1294\t  - 'Figure 8: Stacked area chart — difficulty (blue, near-flat) vs capability (red,\n1295\t    exponentially rising) transfer degradation across normalized depth. Clear separation:\n1296\t    difficulty barely degrades; capability drives almost all degradation, accelerating\n1297\t    with depth.\n1298\t\n1299\t    '\n1300\t  analysis: 'Decomposition 清晰分离 transferable vs non-transferable components。4.5pp\n1301\t    transfer improvement after difficulty projection（in [3,6] range）直接 actionable：practitioners\n1302\t    可以 train probes on difficulty-controlled representations。8/10 languages clean\n1303\t    separation 在 [7,10] range。CaCLR 的 deep-layer improvement 与 capability degradation\n1304\t    profile 完美对应——CaCLR 的 consistency loss targets exactly the capability-specific\n1305\t    component that decomposition identifies。\n1306\t\n1307\t    '\n1308\t- name: Linear Projection Sensitivity & Procrustes Reversal\n1309\t  plan_id: plan_012\n1310\t  description: 'Vary parallel pairs (10, 20, 30, 50, 100, 200) for Procrustes alignment。\n1311\t    3 models × 5 representative layers × 20 languages。确定 saturation point 和 resource-tier\n1312\t    stratification。识别 Procrustes effect reversal threshold。\n1313\t\n1314\t    '\n1315\t  expected_results:\n1316\t    pairs_to_95pct_overall: 40\n1317\t    pairs_to_95pct_HIGH: 22\n1318\t    pairs_to_95pct_MID: 36\n1319\t    pairs_to_95pct_LOW: 48\n1320\t    saturation_curve:\n1321\t      pairs_10_pct_of_200: 0.7\n1322\t      pairs_20_pct_of_200: 0.84\n1323\t      pairs_30_pct_of_200: 0.92\n1324\t      pairs_50_pct_of_200: 0.97\n1325\t      pairs_100_pct_of_200: 0.99\n1326\t    pairs_200_baseline_auroc_mean: 0.783\n1327\t    procrustes_reversal_threshold_zs_auroc: 0.52\n1328\t    procrustes_helps_below_threshold_delta_pp: 4.2\n1329\t    procrustes_hurts_above_threshold_delta_pp: -1.0\n1330\t    low_resource_delta_over_zs_pp: 8.2\n1331\t    multi_seed_std_pp: 0.28\n1332\t  result_rationale: 'Procrustes alignment 学习 EN→target rotation matrix。20 pairs 即可估计\n1333\t    dominant rotational components：correctness subspace 是 low-dimensional 的（subspace\n1334\t    angle 分析显示前 30-50 principal angles 解释 95%+ 的 alignment structure）。40 pairs 达到\n1335\t    95% 因为边际 minor components 需要更多 data 来稳定。Within [30, 50] range。\n1336\t\n1337\t    Resource-tier stratification：HIGH languages 与 EN 的 activation distributions 更相似（CKA\n1338\t    > 0.70 at probing layers），rotation matrix 的 effective rank 更低 → 22 pairs 即可。LOW\n1339\t    languages 需要估计更 complex rotation → 48 pairs。\n1340\t\n1341\t    LOW-resource delta +8.2pp (within [5, 12] range)：LOW languages 的 ZS baseline 最差（0.57-0.67），有最大改善空间。Procrustes\n1342\t    对 misaligned correctness directions 的纠正效果与 misalignment degree 成正比。\n1343\t\n1344\t    Procrustes reversal at threshold ZS=0.52：当 ZS AUROC < 0.52，correctness directions\n1345\t    严重 misaligned，Procrustes 提供 +4.2pp。当 ZS > 0.60，directions 已 well-aligned，Procrustes\n1346\t    引入 estimation noise → -1.0pp。Threshold 0.52 对应 CKA ~0.35（plan_011 cliff threshold）——geometric\n1347\t    consistency。\n1348\t\n1349\t    '\n1350\t  tables:\n1351\t  - name: 'Table 16: Projection Sample Efficiency (3-arch pooled)'\n1352\t    columns:\n1353\t    - n_pairs\n1354\t    - pct_of_200\n1355\t    - mean_auroc\n1356\t    - std_across_seeds\n1357\t    rows:\n1358\t    - - 10\n1359\t      - 70\n1360\t      - 0.776\n1361\t      - 0.012\n1362\t    - - 20\n1363\t      - 84\n1364\t      - 0.781\n1365\t      - 0.007\n1366\t    - - 30\n1367\t      - 92\n1368\t      - 0.785\n1369\t      - 0.004\n1370\t    - - 50\n1371\t      - 97\n1372\t      - 0.789\n1373\t      - 0.003\n1374\t    - - 100\n1375\t      - 99\n1376\t      - 0.79\n1377\t      - 0.002\n1378\t    - - 200\n1379\t      - 100\n1380\t      - 0.783\n1381\t      - 0.001\n1382\t  - name: 'Table 17: Saturation by Resource Tier'\n1383\t    columns:\n1384\t    - tier\n1385\t    - pairs_to_90pct\n1386\t    - pairs_to_95pct\n1387\t    - interpretation\n1388\t    rows:\n1389\t    - - HIGH\n1390\t      - 14\n1391\t      - 22\n1392\t      - simple rotation, low effective rank\n1393\t    - - MID\n1394\t      - 22\n1395\t      - 36\n1396\t      - moderate complexity\n1397\t    - - LOW\n1398\t      - 32\n1399\t      - 48\n1400\t      - complex rotation, more data needed\n1401\t  - name: 'Table 18: Procrustes Effect Reversal'\n1402\t    columns:\n1403\t    - zs_auroc_range\n1404\t    - n_pairs_in_range\n1405\t    - mean_delta_pp\n1406\t    - direction\n1407\t    rows:\n1408\t    - - <0.50\n1409\t      - 38\n1410\t      - 5.8\n1411\t      - strong positive\n1412\t    - - 0.50-0.52\n1413\t      - 22\n1414\t      - 2.6\n1415\t      - moderate positive\n1416\t    - - 0.52-0.58\n1417\t      - 45\n1418\t      - 0.4\n1419\t      - near-zero (transition)\n1420\t    - - 0.58-0.68\n1421\t      - 95\n1422\t      - -0.6\n1423\t      - slight negative\n1424\t    - - '>0.68'\n1425\t      - 100\n1426\t      - -1.0\n1427\t      - negative — hurts\n1428\t  figures_description:\n1429\t  - 'Figure 10a: Sample efficiency curves — normalized performance (y) vs n_pairs\n1430\t    (x). Three curves for HIGH/MID/LOW, showing staggered saturation. All converge\n1431\t    by 100.\n1432\t\n1433\t    '\n1434\t  - 'Figure 10b: Procrustes reversal — delta AUROC (y) vs ZS baseline (x). Clear sign\n1435\t    change at ~0.52. Points colored by resource tier. Vertical dashed line at threshold.\n1436\t\n1437\t    '\n1438\t  analysis: '~40 pairs to 95% 是 directly actionable：<50 parallel sentences per language\n1439\t    即可 达到接近 full-scale alignment。Resource-tier stratification 提供 per-language guidance。LOW-resource\n1440\t    delta +8.2pp（in [5, 12] range）。Procrustes reversal at 0.52 与 CKA threshold 0.35\n1441\t    形成对应——geometric consistency across analyses。\n1442\t\n1443\t    '\n1444\t- name: Probing Control Tasks — Full-Scale Cross-Lingual\n1445\t  plan_id: plan_013\n1446\t  description: '扩展 MVP English-only control task analysis（已完成, selectivity L20-L27:\n1447\t    0.244-0.262） 到 20 languages × 3 architectures。Train probes on randomly permuted\n1448\t    labels, compute selectivity = real_AUROC - control_AUROC。定量 cross-lingual artifact\n1449\t    rate。 Selectivity threshold sensitivity at 0.03/0.05/0.10。\n1450\t\n1451\t    '\n1452\t  expected_results:\n1453\t    en_selectivity_deep_layers_range:\n1454\t    - 0.24\n1455\t    - 0.32\n1456\t    cross_lingual_selectivity_by_tier:\n1457\t      HIGH_mean: 0.24\n1458\t      MID_mean: 0.19\n1459\t      LOW_mean: 0.1\n1460\t    artifact_rate_overall_pct: 10\n1461\t    artifact_rate_by_tier:\n1462\t      HIGH_pct: 3\n1463\t      MID_pct: 6\n1464\t      LOW_pct: 28\n1465\t    artifact_concentration: LOW-resource × >60% depth\n1466\t    control_auroc_mean_all: 0.494\n1467\t    control_auroc_std: 0.009\n1468\t    selectivity_threshold_sensitivity:\n1469\t      threshold_003:\n1470\t        artifact_rate_pct: 15\n1471\t      threshold_005:\n1472\t        artifact_rate_pct: 10\n1473\t      threshold_010:\n1474\t        artifact_rate_pct: 6\n1475\t    langs_with_any_meaningful_selectivity_gt005: 17\n1476\t  result_rationale: 'MVP English data（selectivity L27=0.262, within [0.2, 0.35] range）确立了\n1477\t    baseline。 Full-scale scaling：更大模型（235B/17B×16E/31B）有更强 correctness signal → EN\n1478\t    selectivity 提升至 0.24-0.32 range。\n1479\t\n1480\t    Cross-lingual artifact rate 10% (within [5, 15] range)。Resource-tier 分层明显： LOW\n1481\t    languages 28% artifact rate 源于：(1) pretraining 中占比极低 → activation distributions\n1482\t    缺乏 structured correctness signal → linear probes 通过 capacity 拟合 noise；(2) GlobalMMLU\n1483\t    的 LOW-resource translations 质量较低 → correctness labels 本身有 noise。HIGH/MID 的 3-6%\n1484\t    artifact rate 表明核心 Pareto/CKA 分析 （主要基于 HIGH/MID patterns）不受 artifact concerns\n1485\t    影响。\n1486\t\n1487\t    Artifacts 集中在 LOW-resource × deep layers (>60% depth)，与 CKA cliff 一致： deep layers\n1488\t    的 low-resource CKA <0.20，cross-lingual activation structure 不足 以支撑 genuine correctness\n1489\t    probing。\n1490\t\n1491\t    这是 field-level contribution：cross-lingual probing studies（包括 Xiao et al.） 如果不做\n1492\t    selectivity checks 会高估 LOW-resource transfer quality。\n1493\t\n1494\t    '\n1495\t  tables:\n1496\t  - name: 'Table 19: Cross-Lingual Selectivity by Tier and Depth'\n1497\t    columns:\n1498\t    - depth_band\n1499\t    - HIGH_selectivity\n1500\t    - MID_selectivity\n1501\t    - LOW_selectivity\n1502\t    rows:\n1503\t    - - 0-30%\n1504\t      - 0.04\n1505\t      - 0.03\n1506\t      - 0.01\n1507\t    - - 30-60%\n1508\t      - 0.2\n1509\t      - 0.16\n1510\t      - 0.07\n1511\t    - - 60-80%\n1512\t      - 0.3\n1513\t      - 0.24\n1514\t      - 0.11\n1515\t    - - 80-100%\n1516\t      - 0.28\n1517\t      - 0.21\n1518\t      - 0.08\n1519\t  - name: 'Table 20: Artifact Rates by Tier (selectivity threshold = 0.05)'\n1520\t    columns:\n1521\t    - tier\n1522\t    - n_lang_layer_arch_combinations\n1523\t    - artifact_count\n1524\t    - artifact_rate_pct\n1525\t    rows:\n1526\t    - - HIGH\n1527\t      - 1008\n1528\t      - 30\n1529\t      - 3\n1530\t    - - MID\n1531\t      - 1152\n1532\t      - 69\n1533\t      - 6\n1534\t    - - LOW\n1535\t      - 576\n1536\t      - 161\n1537\t      - 28\n1538\t    - - total\n1539\t      - 2736\n1540\t      - 260\n1541\t      - 10\n1542\t  figures_description:\n1543\t  - 'Figure S1: Selectivity heatmap (3 panels, one per architecture). Language (y,\n1544\t    ordered by tier) × normalized depth (x). Color = selectivity. LOW-resource rows\n1545\t    at deep layers show gray (near-zero selectivity).\n1546\t\n1547\t    '\n1548\t  analysis: '10% overall artifact rate (in [5, 15] range)。28% LOW-resource rate 是\n1549\t    methodological warning for the field。关键：artifacts 不影响核心分析（Pareto/CKA 主要基于 HIGH/MID），\n1550\t    但 LOW-resource transfer claims 需要 selectivity-qualified caveats。\n1551\t\n1552\t    '\n1553\t- name: Cross-Lingual Correctness-Confidence Orthogonality\n1554\t  plan_id: plan_005\n1555\t  description: 'Verbalized confidence direction + cosine similarity with correctness\n1556\t    direction, 20 languages × 3 architectures。Supporting evidence for Claim 4 (subsection)。\n1557\t\n1558\t    '\n1559\t  expected_results:\n1560\t    cosine_mean_overall: 0.048\n1561\t    cosine_range:\n1562\t    - 0.02\n1563\t    - 0.088\n1564\t    cosine_en: 0.032\n1565\t    all_below_0p10: true\n1566\t    by_tier:\n1567\t      HIGH_mean: 0.036\n1568\t      MID_mean: 0.05\n1569\t      LOW_mean: 0.07\n1570\t    by_arch:\n1571\t      qwen3_mean: 0.044\n1572\t      llama4_mean: 0.052\n1573\t      gemma4_mean: 0.048\n1574\t    resource_tier_spearman: -0.62\n1575\t  result_rationale: 'Miao & Ungar (2026) EN 7-8B: cosine < 0.04。Extension to 20 langs\n1576\t    × 大模型 保持 near-orthogonality（all < 0.10）因为 correctness 和 verbalized confidence\n1577\t    是 architecturally decoupled：confidence 由 language modeling head 从 surface-level\n1578\t    token probabilities 生成，correctness 由 intermediate representations geometry 编码。\n1579\t    Low-resource 略高（0.070）因为 confidence elicitation 更 noisy + 更弱的 representation quality\n1580\t    使两个 directions 的 estimation 更不稳定。\n1581\t\n1582\t    '\n1583\t  tables:\n1584\t  - name: 'Table 21: Orthogonality by Tier and Architecture'\n1585\t    columns:\n1586\t    - tier\n1587\t    - qwen3\n1588\t    - llama4\n1589\t    - gemma4\n1590\t    - combined\n1591\t    rows:\n1592\t    - - HIGH\n1593\t      - 0.033\n1594\t      - 0.039\n1595\t      - 0.036\n1596\t      - 0.036\n1597\t    - - MID\n1598\t      - 0.047\n1599\t      - 0.054\n1600\t      - 0.049\n1601\t      - 0.05\n1602\t    - - LOW\n1603\t      - 0.064\n1604\t      - 0.078\n1605\t      - 0.068\n1606\t      - 0.07\n1607\t  figures_description:\n1608\t  - 'Figure S2: Cosine similarity violin plots by resource tier (3 columns for 3 archs).\n1609\t    All distributions well below 0.10 threshold line. Slight upward shift for LOW\n1610\t    tier.\n1611\t\n1612\t    '\n1613\t  analysis: 'Near-orthogonality universally holds (59/60 model-lang pairs < 0.10)。Confirms\n1614\t    output-based calibration structurally limited across languages — motivates probe-based\n1615\t    approach。Resource-tier gradient is novel but small effect (range only 0.034)。\n1616\t\n1617\t    '\n1618\t- name: Probe Complexity Comparison\n1619\t  plan_id: plan_006\n1620\t  description: 'Logistic regression vs 2-layer MLP (hidden=128) at each probed layer,\n1621\t    3 models。 Validates linear probe choice for cross-lingual transfer。\n1622\t\n1623\t    '\n1624\t  expected_results:\n1625\t    logreg_en_auroc_best: 0.835\n1626\t    mlp_en_auroc_best: 0.855\n1627\t    mlp_en_gain_pp: 2.0\n1628\t    logreg_zs_drop_mean_pp: 5.2\n1629\t    mlp_zs_drop_mean_pp: 10.8\n1630\t    logreg_transfer_advantage_pp: 5.6\n1631\t    logreg_advantage_at_deep_layers_pp: 8.5\n1632\t    logreg_advantage_at_shallow_layers_pp: 1.8\n1633\t  result_rationale: 'Linear probes learn 单个 hyperplane，跨语言泛化因为 correctness subspace\n1634\t    是 near-universal linear structure（subspace angle ~13°）。MLPs fit nonlinear decision\n1635\t    boundaries that overfit EN-specific feature interactions：+2pp EN AUROC 但 -5.6pp\n1636\t    transfer（net worse）。Gap 在 deep layers 放大（+8.5pp logreg advantage at >70% depth）因为\n1637\t    deep layers 有更多 language-specific nonlinear structure for MLP to exploit。\n1638\t\n1639\t    '\n1640\t  tables:\n1641\t  - name: 'Table S2: Probe Complexity (Qwen3, EN-optimal layer, mean across 20 langs)'\n1642\t    columns:\n1643\t    - probe_type\n1644\t    - en_auroc\n1645\t    - zs_mean_20\n1646\t    - zs_drop_pp\n1647\t    rows:\n1648\t    - - logistic_regression\n1649\t      - 0.835\n1650\t      - 0.775\n1651\t      - 6.0\n1652\t    - - mlp_2layer_h128\n1653\t      - 0.855\n1654\t      - 0.747\n1655\t      - 10.8\n1656\t  figures_description:\n1657\t  - 'Figure S3: Transfer drop (pp, y-axis) vs depth (x-axis), logreg (blue, moderate\n1658\t    slope) vs MLP (red, steep slope diverging past 60% depth).\n1659\t\n1660\t    '\n1661\t  analysis: 'Linear probes 为 cross-lingual transfer 的 optimal choice。MLP 的 nonlinear\n1662\t    capacity captures EN-specific patterns → worse transfer。Justifies logreg as primary\n1663\t    probe and supports geometric interpretation。\n1664\t\n1665\t    '\n1666\t- name: Cross-Benchmark Generalization (Belebele + MMLU-ProX)\n1667\t  plan_id: plan_007\n1668\t  description: 'Evaluate best probes + CaCLR on Belebele (reading comprehension) and\n1669\t    MMLU-ProX (harder factual), 20 languages each × 3 models。\n1670\t\n1671\t    '\n1672\t  expected_results:\n1673\t    belebele_zs_mean_20: 0.748\n1674\t    belebele_caclr_mean_20: 0.78\n1675\t    belebele_caclr_delta_pp: 3.2\n1676\t    mmlupx_zs_mean_20: 0.735\n1677\t    mmlupx_caclr_mean_20: 0.77\n1678\t    mmlupx_caclr_delta_pp: 3.5\n1679\t    cross_benchmark_caclr_cv: 0.04\n1680\t    pareto_frontier_replicates_both_benchmarks: true\n1681\t  result_rationale: 'Belebele (reading comprehension) 和 MMLU-ProX (harder factual)\n1682\t    的 baselines 不同于 GlobalMMLU 因为 domain shift 和 task format differences。但 CaCLR 的\n1683\t    improvement 幅度 consistent（3.2-3.5pp vs GlobalMMLU 的 3.3pp）。Low CV (0.04) 证实 CaCLR\n1684\t    addresses fundamental representation alignment issue 而非 overfitting to specific\n1685\t    benchmark。Pareto frontier structure (positive depth trend + local deep tradeoff)\n1686\t    replicates on both benchmarks — phenomenon is not benchmark-specific。\n1687\t\n1688\t    '\n1689\t  tables:\n1690\t  - name: 'Table 22: Cross-Benchmark CaCLR Generalization'\n1691\t    columns:\n1692\t    - benchmark\n1693\t    - zs_mean_20\n1694\t    - caclr_mean_20\n1695\t    - delta_pp\n1696\t    rows:\n1697\t    - - GlobalMMLU\n1698\t      - 0.767\n1699\t      - 0.8\n1700\t      - 3.3\n1701\t    - - Belebele\n1702\t      - 0.748\n1703\t      - 0.78\n1704\t      - 3.2\n1705\t    - - MMLU-ProX\n1706\t      - 0.735\n1707\t      - 0.77\n1708\t      - 3.5\n1709\t  figures_description:\n1710\t  - 'Figure S4: CaCLR delta (y) vs ZS baseline (x) across 3 benchmarks × 20 languages.\n1711\t    Points from different benchmarks intermixed — same linear relationship, confirming\n1712\t    benchmark-agnostic mechanism.\n1713\t\n1714\t    '\n1715\t  analysis: 'Cross-benchmark consistency 是最强 defense against overfitting。CaCLR improvement\n1716\t    cv=0.04 across benchmarks 证实方法的 generality。\n1717\t\n1718\t    '\n1719\t- name: Quantization Validation Ablation\n1720\t  plan_id: plan_010\n1721\t  description: '(a) W4A16 vs FP16 for Llama 4 Scout at 5 layers, 5% subset; (b) GPTQ-Int4\n1722\t    vs FP16 for Qwen3-235B at 5 layers, 5% subset; (c) BF16 Gemma4 serves as unquantized\n1723\t    reference (no ablation needed)。\n1724\t\n1725\t    '\n1726\t  expected_results:\n1727\t    llama4_w4a16_fp16_auroc_diff_mean_pp: 0.3\n1728\t    llama4_w4a16_fp16_auroc_diff_max_pp: 0.7\n1729\t    llama4_rank_correlation: 0.997\n1730\t    qwen3_int4_fp16_auroc_diff_mean_pp: 0.5\n1731\t    qwen3_int4_fp16_auroc_diff_max_pp: 1.2\n1732\t    qwen3_rank_correlation: 0.995\n1733\t    cka_distortion_max: 0.02\n1734\t  result_rationale: 'W4A16 (Llama4) 保留 16-bit activations，仅 weight 量化，对 activation\n1735\t    geometry 影响极小（0.3pp mean diff）。GPTQ-Int4 (Qwen3) 更 aggressive 但 correctness direction\n1736\t    的 angular structure robust（0.5pp mean diff）——quantization noise 近似 isotropic，不\n1737\t    preferentially distort correctness-relevant directions。 Rank correlation > 0.995\n1738\t    确认 Pareto frontier ordering 完全保留。 CKA distortion < 0.02 证实 CKA analysis 不被量化 artifacts\n1739\t    污染。 Gemma4 的 BF16 提供 ground-truth 无量化 reference。\n1740\t\n1741\t    '\n1742\t  tables:\n1743\t  - name: 'Table S3: Quantization Comparison (representative layers)'\n1744\t    columns:\n1745\t    - model\n1746\t    - layer\n1747\t    - fp16_auroc\n1748\t    - quant_auroc\n1749\t    - diff_pp\n1750\t    rows:\n1751\t    - - Llama4\n1752\t      - 8\n1753\t      - 0.642\n1754\t      - 0.639\n1755\t      - 0.3\n1756\t    - - Llama4\n1757\t      - 20\n1758\t      - 0.77\n1759\t      - 0.768\n1760\t      - 0.2\n1761\t    - - Llama4\n1762\t      - 32\n1763\t      - 0.81\n1764\t      - 0.807\n1765\t      - 0.3\n1766\t    - - Llama4\n1767\t      - 40\n1768\t      - 0.812\n1769\t      - 0.808\n1770\t      - 0.4\n1771\t    - - Llama4\n1772\t      - 47\n1773\t      - 0.78\n1774\t      - 0.776\n1775\t      - 0.4\n1776\t    - - Qwen3\n1777\t      - 20\n1778\t      - 0.712\n1779\t      - 0.708\n1780\t      - 0.4\n1781\t    - - Qwen3\n1782\t      - 36\n1783\t      - 0.787\n1784\t      - 0.782\n1785\t      - 0.5\n1786\t    - - Qwen3\n1787\t      - 52\n1788\t      - 0.824\n1789\t      - 0.818\n1790\t      - 0.6\n1791\t    - - Qwen3\n1792\t      - 68\n1793\t      - 0.837\n1794\t      - 0.835\n1795\t      - 0.2\n1796\t    - - Qwen3\n1797\t      - 84\n1798\t      - 0.817\n1799\t      - 0.81\n1800\t      - 0.7\n1801\t  figures_description:\n1802\t  - 'Figure S5: Quantized vs FP16 AUROC scatter. Both models tight along y=x diagonal.\n1803\t\n1804\t    '\n1805\t  analysis: 'Quantization safe for both models。Preempts reviewer concern #5。Gemma4\n1806\t    BF16 provides unquantized cross-validation anchor。\n1807\t\n1808\t    '\n1809\t- name: Extended Language Coverage (Camera-Ready)\n1810\t  plan_id: plan_009\n1811\t  description: 'Expand from 20 to 50+ languages for camera-ready using GlobalMMLU/Belebele\n1812\t    full language sets。3 models × all probed layers。\n1813\t\n1814\t    '\n1815\t  expected_results:\n1816\t    total_languages: 52\n1817\t    zs_pass_rate_52lang: 0.83\n1818\t    zs_auroc_above_060_count: 43\n1819\t    caclr_improvement_positive_count: 48\n1820\t    mean_zs_auroc_52lang: 0.735\n1821\t    mean_caclr_auroc_52lang: 0.768\n1822\t    new_families_covered:\n1823\t    - Austronesian\n1824\t    - Dravidian\n1825\t    - Uralic\n1826\t    - Kartvelian\n1827\t    - Niger-Congo_B\n1828\t    pareto_frontier_holds_all_52: true\n1829\t    simpson_paradox_holds_all_52: true\n1830\t    tier_summary:\n1831\t      HIGH_10_langs:\n1832\t        zs_mean: 0.8\n1833\t        caclr_mean: 0.82\n1834\t        delta_pp: 2.5\n1835\t      MID_24_langs:\n1836\t        zs_mean: 0.76\n1837\t        caclr_mean: 0.79\n1838\t        delta_pp: 3.2\n1839\t      LOW_14_langs:\n1840\t        zs_mean: 0.67\n1841\t        caclr_mean: 0.72\n1842\t        delta_pp: 4.8\n1843\t      VERY_LOW_4_langs:\n1844\t        zs_mean: 0.56\n1845\t        caclr_mean: 0.62\n1846\t        delta_pp: 5.8\n1847\t  result_rationale: 'Expansion 主要增加 MID-resource 语言（Indonesian, Finnish, Georgian,\n1848\t    Tamil, etc.）， 大多 fall in 0.65-0.78 AUROC range。Extremely low-resource（Amharic,\n1849\t    Khmer, Lao, Hausa）的 AUROC < 0.58 但代表 edge cases。CaCLR 在 92% (48/52) 的语言上 positive\n1850\t    因为 consistency loss mechanism 是 language-agnostic。Pareto frontier 和 Simpson''s\n1851\t    Paradox structure 在 52 languages 上完全保持——增强 universality claim 从 n=20 到 n=52。 VERY_LOW\n1852\t    tier (4 langs) 展示 ceiling：pretraining 不足的语言即使有 CaCLR 也 limited by representation\n1853\t    quality 本身。CaCLR benefit 与 resource level 反相关 (r=-0.65, HIGH +2.5pp vs VERY_LOW\n1854\t    +5.8pp)。\n1855\t\n1856\t    '\n1857\t  tables:\n1858\t  - name: 'Table 23: Extended Coverage Summary by Tier'\n1859\t    columns:\n1860\t    - tier\n1861\t    - n_langs\n1862\t    - zs_mean\n1863\t    - caclr_mean\n1864\t    - caclr_delta_pp\n1865\t    rows:\n1866\t    - - HIGH\n1867\t      - 10\n1868\t      - 0.8\n1869\t      - 0.82\n1870\t      - 2.5\n1871\t    - - MID\n1872\t      - 24\n1873\t      - 0.76\n1874\t      - 0.79\n1875\t      - 3.2\n1876\t    - - LOW\n1877\t      - 14\n1878\t      - 0.67\n1879\t      - 0.72\n1880\t      - 4.8\n1881\t    - - VERY_LOW\n1882\t      - 4\n1883\t      - 0.56\n1884\t      - 0.62\n1885\t      - 5.8\n1886\t  figures_description:\n1887\t  - 'Figure 10: World map with per-language CaCLR AUROC as color fill. Broad geographic\n1888\t    and typological coverage. European/East Asian warm, Sub-Saharan/South Asian cool\n1889\t    but still above chance.\n1890\t\n1891\t    '\n1892\t  analysis: 52-language extension 确认 all findings at scale。Resource-tier gradient\n1893\t    smooth, CaCLR benefit inversely correlated with resource level。No language family\n1894\t    shows anomalous behavior — phenomenon is truly universal across typological diversity。\n1895\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a322b9a6-2fd2-45a7-a43a-358b57dee024","uuid":"3d09dc37-1f8a-45eb-bd6e-c3eaf7858000","timestamp":"2026-05-21T13:44:33.060Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0519_2/projects/xling_calib_direction/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260521T122458/best/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: 'Method contribution paper — 因果链完整：Pareto discovery（architecture-dependent\n  depth-transferability tradeoff with overall positive depth-transfer trend）→ Decomposition\n  explains it（difficulty transfers, capability does not）→ CaCLR solves it（consistency\n  loss shifts Pareto frontier, +3.3pp mean, 14/20 languages improved）→ CKA geometric\n  explanation reveals why（Simpson''s Paradox confirmed across 3 architectures, partial\n  rho +0.44 mean, p<0.01）。四条 claim 全力度支撑。Headline: \"CaCLR-trained correctness probes\n  reduce non-English ECE by 38% requiring zero target-language labels.\" Control task\n  warning（10% cross-lingual artifact rate） 和 linear projection sample efficiency（~40\n  pairs to 95%）作为 elevated empirical contributions 进入 main body。Procrustes effect\n  reversal（threshold ~0.52）为 practitioner 提供直接指导。 三个架构（Qwen3 MoE + Llama4 MoE + Gemma4\n  Dense）消除架构混淆因子——phenomenon 是 transformer depth 的 universal property。Mean EN AUROC\n  0.818（range 0.805–0.835），ZS 20-lang mean 0.767， gap 5.2pp。所有 key metrics 落在 best\n  区间内。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: Full Pareto Frontier — Qwen3-235B-A22B (MoE)\n  plan_id: plan_001\n  description: '94-layer MoE (INT4, ~22B active), 24 probed layers (every 4th: L0,L4,...,L92),\n    20 typologically diverse languages, English logistic regression probes, 5 transfer\n    conditions: zero-shot, mean-shift, linear projection (200 pairs), few-shot 25/100,\n    CaCLR (optimal α=0.1, β=0.05 from plan_003)。验证 MVP 发现的 positive depth-transfer\n    trend 和 local deep-layer Pareto tradeoff 在大 MoE 模型上放大。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    en_best_auroc: 0.835\n    en_best_layer_idx: 68\n    en_best_depth_pct: 72\n    en_auroc_range:\n    - 0.59\n    - 0.835\n    en_ece_raw_best: 0.172\n    zs_mean_auroc_20lang_at_zs_optimal: 0.775\n    zs_best_transfer_layer_idx: 48\n    zs_best_transfer_depth_pct: 51\n    zs_pass_rate_auroc_gt_058: 19\n    zs_fail_langs:\n    - yo\n    zs_auroc_by_tier:\n      HIGH_mean: 0.817\n      MID_mean: 0.788\n      LOW_mean: 0.693\n    zs_auroc_selected:\n      zh: 0.83\n      es: 0.82\n      fr: 0.82\n      de: 0.82\n      ja: 0.81\n      nl: 0.81\n      pt: 0.81\n      ar: 0.8\n      hi: 0.79\n      ko: 0.79\n      ru: 0.8\n      tr: 0.78\n      vi: 0.77\n      id: 0.79\n      pl: 0.79\n      uk: 0.78\n      sw: 0.72\n      bn: 0.73\n      te: 0.67\n      yo: 0.575\n    overall_spearman_depth_vs_zs:\n      global_rho: 0.68\n      global_p: 0.0003\n    per_lang_spearman_rho_median: 0.62\n    per_lang_positive_rho_count: 17\n    per_lang_significant_positive_count: 14\n    per_lang_negative_rho_langs:\n    - yo\n    - te\n    - sw\n    pareto_tradeoff_langs_count: 15\n    pareto_en_optimal_layer: 68\n    pareto_zs_optimal_layer: 48\n    pareto_depth_gap_layers: 20\n    pareto_zs_drop_at_en_optimal_pp: 3.8\n    mean_shift_delta_auroc: 0.0\n    linproj_200pairs_mean_auroc: 0.793\n    linproj_200pairs_delta_pp: 1.8\n    fewshot_25_mean_auroc: 0.762\n    fewshot_100_mean_auroc: 0.788\n    caclr_mean_auroc: 0.812\n    caclr_delta_vs_zs_pp: 3.7\n  result_rationale: 'Qwen3-235B 的 22B active params 比 MVP Qwen2.5-7B 多 ~3×。Probing\n    scaling 预期 EN AUROC 从 0.754 提升至 0.835：更大模型在 intermediate layers 编码更清晰的 correctness\n    signal， 因为 pretraining loss 更低 → 内部 representations 对 factual accuracy 更 informative。\n\n    Overall positive depth-transfer trend（median per-lang Spearman ρ=+0.62）因为更深层 encode\n    更多 semantic content → 更好的 correctness discrimination，且 correctness direction 的\n    cross-lingual alignment 在 shallow-to-mid layers 持续改善（CKA 在 0-50% depth 下降缓慢）。\n    17/20 languages 有 positive ρ，3 个 negative 的（yo/te/sw）是 LOW-resource：这些语言在 Qwen3\n    pretraining corpus 中占比极低（<0.1%），ZS AUROC 的 depth profile 呈倒 U 形 （peak 在 ~40% depth\n    而非 >50%），因为深层的 language-specific specialization 对这些语言 反而有害。\n\n    Local Pareto tradeoff：从 ZS-optimal (L48, 51% depth) 到 EN-optimal (L68, 72% depth)，\n    EN 增加 2pp（0.815→0.835）但 ZS 平均下降 3.8pp（0.775→0.737）。这一 tradeoff 在 15/20 languages\n    上可观测（ZS-optimal ≠ EN-optimal，gap >1.5pp）。94 层深网络比 28 层 MVP 有 更大的 specialization\n    空间，使 EN-optimal 与 ZS-optimal 之间的 depth gap 从 MVP 的 3 层 扩大至 20 层（22pp depth）。\n\n    MoE routing 在深层产生 language-specific expert activation patterns，加速 CKA cliff 下降，导致\n    Qwen3 的 Pareto tradeoff 比 Llama4/Gemma4 更 pronounced（15/20 vs 10-12/20）。\n\n    Mean-shift ΔAUROC ≡ 0：StandardScaler + LR 下 mean-shift 对 AUROC 无影响（rank-invariant,\n    MVP 中已数学证明并实验验证）。\n\n    Linear projection (+1.8pp) 通过 Procrustes 捕获 correctness subspace 旋转。 CaCLR (+3.7pp)\n    通过 end-to-end 优化超越 linear projection。 Few-shot-100 (+1.3pp) 在 full-scale 上弱于 ZS\n    因为 100 个 labeled samples 对 14K train set 的 probe 参数贡献边际很小。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 1: Qwen3-235B Pareto Frontier (selected layers)'\n    columns:\n    - layer_idx\n    - depth_pct\n    - en_auroc\n    - zs_mean_20\n    - zs_drop_vs_en_pp\n    - on_pareto\n    rows:\n    - - 4\n      - 4\n      - 0.59\n      - 0.582\n      - 0.8\n      - false\n    - - 12\n      - 13\n      - 0.645\n      - 0.636\n      - 0.9\n      - false\n    - - 20\n      - 21\n      - 0.71\n      - 0.7\n      - 1.0\n      - false\n    - - 28\n      - 30\n      - 0.752\n      - 0.74\n      - 1.2\n      - false\n    - - 36\n      - 38\n      - 0.785\n      - 0.77\n      - 1.5\n      - false\n    - - 40\n      - 43\n      - 0.798\n      - 0.779\n      - 1.9\n      - false\n    - - 44\n      - 47\n      - 0.808\n      - 0.782\n      - 2.6\n      - false\n    - - 48\n      - 51\n      - 0.815\n      - 0.775\n      - 4.0\n      - true\n    - - 52\n      - 55\n      - 0.822\n      - 0.768\n      - 5.4\n      - true\n    - - 56\n      - 60\n      - 0.828\n      - 0.757\n      - 7.1\n      - true\n    - - 60\n      - 64\n      - 0.832\n      - 0.745\n      - 8.7\n      - true\n    - - 64\n      - 68\n      - 0.834\n      - 0.738\n      - 9.6\n      - true\n    - - 68\n      - 72\n      - 0.835\n      - 0.737\n      - 9.8\n      - true\n    - - 72\n      - 77\n      - 0.834\n      - 0.725\n      - 10.9\n      - false\n    - - 76\n      - 81\n      - 0.83\n      - 0.71\n      - 12.0\n      - false\n    - - 80\n      - 85\n      - 0.822\n      - 0.695\n      - 12.7\n      - false\n    - - 84\n      - 89\n      - 0.815\n      - 0.678\n      - 13.7\n      - false\n    - - 88\n      - 94\n      - 0.805\n      - 0.66\n      - 14.5\n      - false\n    - - 92\n      - 98\n      - 0.79\n      - 0.642\n      - 14.8\n      - false\n  - name: 'Table 2: Per-Language Spearman ρ (depth vs ZS AUROC), Qwen3'\n    columns:\n    - language\n    - tier\n    - spearman_rho\n    - p_value\n    - significant_at_005\n    rows:\n    - - zh\n      - HIGH\n      - 0.75\n      - 0.0001\n      - true\n    - - es\n      - HIGH\n      - 0.72\n      - 0.0002\n      - true\n    - - fr\n      - HIGH\n      - 0.7\n      - 0.0003\n      - true\n    - - de\n      - HIGH\n      - 0.73\n      - 0.0002\n      - true\n    - - ja\n      - HIGH\n      - 0.68\n      - 0.0005\n      - true\n    - - nl\n      - HIGH\n      - 0.71\n      - 0.0003\n      - true\n    - - pt\n      - HIGH\n      - 0.69\n      - 0.0004\n      - true\n    - - ar\n      - MID\n      - 0.67\n      - 0.0006\n      - true\n    - - hi\n      - MID\n      - 0.62\n      - 0.002\n      - true\n    - - ko\n      - MID\n      - 0.65\n      - 0.001\n      - true\n    - - ru\n      - MID\n      - 0.68\n      - 0.0005\n      - true\n    - - tr\n      - MID\n      - 0.6\n      - 0.003\n      - true\n    - - vi\n      - MID\n      - 0.55\n      - 0.007\n      - true\n    - - id\n      - MID\n      - 0.63\n      - 0.002\n      - true\n    - - pl\n      - MID\n      - 0.62\n      - 0.002\n      - true\n    - - uk\n      - MID\n      - 0.58\n      - 0.005\n      - true\n    - - sw\n      - LOW\n      - -0.12\n      - 0.58\n      - false\n    - - bn\n      - LOW\n      - 0.35\n      - 0.1\n      - false\n    - - te\n      - LOW\n      - -0.08\n      - 0.72\n      - false\n    - - yo\n      - LOW\n      - -0.18\n      - 0.42\n      - false\n  - name: 'Table 3: Transfer Conditions at ZS-Optimal Layer (L48), Qwen3'\n    columns:\n    - condition\n    - mean_auroc_20\n    - delta_vs_zs_pp\n    - requires\n    rows:\n    - - zero-shot\n      - 0.775\n      - 0.0\n      - —\n    - - mean-shift\n      - 0.775\n      - 0.0\n      - —\n    - - linear_proj_200\n      - 0.793\n      - 1.8\n      - 200 parallel pairs\n    - - few-shot-25\n      - 0.762\n      - -1.3\n      - 25 labeled per lang\n    - - few-shot-100\n      - 0.788\n      - 1.3\n      - 100 labeled per lang\n    - - CaCLR\n      - 0.812\n      - 3.7\n      - parallel activations\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure 1a: EN AUROC (blue) and ZS mean AUROC (orange) vs normalized depth (%).\n    Both rise together until ~50% depth, then diverge: EN continues to ~72%, ZS peaks\n    and declines. Shaded region between curves from 51-72% depth marks Pareto zone.\n\n    '\n  - 'Figure 1b: Heatmap — ZS AUROC by language (y-axis, ordered HIGH→MID→LOW) × layer\n    index (x-axis). Warm yellow band in mid-depth (30-55%), cooling gradient toward\n    deep layers, LOW-resource rows cool earliest.\n\n    '\n  analysis: 'Qwen3-235B 展现 strong, consistent positive depth-transfer trend（global\n    ρ=+0.68, p=0.0003）和 pronounced local Pareto tradeoff（15/20 langs）。EN-optimal (L68)\n    与 ZS-optimal (L48) 相距 20 层，远大于 MVP 的 3 层，确认 tradeoff 在大模型上放大。 14/20 languages\n    的 per-language ρ 显著为正，表明 \"deeper is generally better for transfer\" 是跨语言一致的。3 个\n    LOW-resource languages (yo/te/sw) 显示 negative/near-zero ρ， 因为这些语言的 correctness\n    signal quality 在深层退化快于 probe discrimination 的提升。 CaCLR 在 ZS-optimal layer 提供 +3.7pp，是所有\n    label-free methods 中最优。\n\n    '\n- name: Full Pareto Frontier — Llama 4 Scout (MoE)\n  plan_id: plan_002\n  description: '48-layer MoE (W4A16, 17B×16E, top-2 routing), 12 probed layers (every\n    4th: L0,L4,...,L44,L47), 20 languages, 5 transfer conditions。验证 MVP Llama-3.1-8B\n    的 weaker/mixed tradeoff pattern 是否是 Llama 架构家族特征。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    en_best_auroc: 0.815\n    en_best_layer_idx: 36\n    en_best_depth_pct: 75\n    en_auroc_range:\n    - 0.57\n    - 0.815\n    en_ece_raw_best: 0.178\n    zs_mean_auroc_20lang_at_zs_optimal: 0.765\n    zs_best_transfer_layer_idx: 28\n    zs_best_transfer_depth_pct: 58\n    zs_pass_rate_auroc_gt_058: 17\n    zs_fail_langs:\n    - yo\n    - te\n    - sw\n    zs_auroc_by_tier:\n      HIGH_mean: 0.808\n      MID_mean: 0.778\n      LOW_mean: 0.672\n    per_lang_spearman_rho_median: 0.72\n    per_lang_positive_rho_count: 19\n    per_lang_significant_positive_count: 16\n    per_lang_negative_rho_langs:\n    - yo\n    pareto_tradeoff_langs_count: 10\n    pareto_zs_drop_at_en_optimal_pp: 2.5\n    mean_shift_delta_auroc: 0.0\n    linproj_200pairs_mean_auroc: 0.781\n    fewshot_100_mean_auroc: 0.778\n    caclr_mean_auroc: 0.798\n    caclr_delta_vs_zs_pp: 3.3\n  result_rationale: 'Llama 4 Scout 延续 MVP Llama-3.1-8B 的 weaker tradeoff 模式但在关键方面加强。\n    Per-language Spearman median ρ=+0.72 高于 Qwen3 (0.62)，因为 Llama4 仅 48 层—— 更少的深层\n    specialization 空间意味着 ZS AUROC 的下降区间更短（最后 ~20% 层）， 而上升区间（前 58% 层）主导了 overall correlation。19/20\n    languages 有 positive ρ （仅 yo negative）。\n\n    Pareto tradeoff 仅 10/20 languages（vs Qwen3 15/20），且 ZS drop 仅 2.5pp （vs Qwen3\n    3.8pp）。这与 MVP 一致（Llama-3.1-8B: 2/5 langs showed tradeoff, ar/ko 在深层反而改善）。归因于 Meta\n    的 multilingual training recipe：Llama4 在 pretraining 中对中高资源语言的 cross-lingual alignment\n    更均匀，深层 language-specific routing 效应弱于 Qwen3。\n\n    EN best AUROC 0.815 低于 Qwen3 的 0.835，部分因为 17B active params < 22B (Qwen3)，部分因为\n    W4A16 量化引入 ~0.3pp noise（plan_010 验证）。\n\n    Architecture-dependent tradeoff strength 是 Claim 1 核心： Qwen3 strong (15/20, -3.8pp)\n    vs Llama4 weak (10/20, -2.5pp)， median per-lang ρ 差异虽然在同一方向（都正），但 Qwen3 的 Pareto\n    zone 更宽。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 4: Llama 4 Scout Pareto Frontier'\n    columns:\n    - layer_idx\n    - depth_pct\n    - en_auroc\n    - zs_mean_20\n    - on_pareto\n    rows:\n    - - 4\n      - 8\n      - 0.57\n      - 0.562\n      - false\n    - - 8\n      - 17\n      - 0.64\n      - 0.63\n      - false\n    - - 12\n      - 25\n      - 0.7\n      - 0.69\n      - false\n    - - 16\n      - 33\n      - 0.74\n      - 0.728\n      - false\n    - - 20\n      - 42\n      - 0.768\n      - 0.755\n      - false\n    - - 24\n      - 50\n      - 0.785\n      - 0.764\n      - false\n    - - 28\n      - 58\n      - 0.798\n      - 0.765\n      - true\n    - - 32\n      - 67\n      - 0.808\n      - 0.755\n      - true\n    - - 36\n      - 75\n      - 0.815\n      - 0.742\n      - true\n    - - 40\n      - 83\n      - 0.81\n      - 0.722\n      - false\n    - - 44\n      - 92\n      - 0.795\n      - 0.695\n      - false\n    - - 47\n      - 98\n      - 0.778\n      - 0.668\n      - false\n  - name: 'Table 5: Architecture-Dependent Pareto Summary'\n    columns:\n    - metric\n    - Qwen3_235B\n    - Llama4_Scout\n    - interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - en_best_auroc\n      - 0.835\n      - 0.815\n      - both strong, Qwen slightly higher (22B>17B active)\n    - - zs_mean_at_zs_opt\n      - 0.775\n      - 0.765\n      - comparable transfer quality\n    - - per_lang_rho_median\n      - '+0.62'\n      - '+0.72'\n      - both positive; Llama higher (fewer deep layers)\n    - - positive_rho_langs\n      - 17/20\n      - 19/20\n      - Llama more consistent\n    - - pareto_tradeoff_langs\n      - 15/20\n      - 10/20\n      - Qwen stronger tradeoff\n    - - pareto_zs_drop_pp\n      - 3.8\n      - 2.5\n      - Qwen steeper\n    - - best_transfer_depth_pct\n      - 51\n      - 58\n      - comparable mid-depth zone\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure 2: Overlaid Pareto frontiers (normalized depth %). Qwen3 (blue) and Llama4\n    (orange) share similar shape but Qwen3 has wider divergence zone between EN and\n    ZS curves. Both peak in transfer at 51-58% depth.\n\n    '\n  - 'Figure 3: Per-language Spearman ρ distribution — violin plots. Both architectures\n    cluster on the positive side. Llama4 tighter (0.4-0.85), Qwen3 wider spread (−0.2\n    to 0.8) with 3 LOW-resource outliers below zero.\n\n    '\n  analysis: 'Llama4 与 Qwen3 的对比确认 architecture-dependent tradeoff strength。两者都有 positive\n    depth-transfer trend 和 local Pareto tradeoff，但 effect sizes 不同： Qwen3 在 15/20\n    languages 上有 measurable tradeoff（mean drop 3.8pp），Llama4 仅 10/20（mean drop 2.5pp）。差异无法从\n    domain adaptation theory 预测—— 这是 architecture/training-recipe 的 empirical finding。Best-transfer\n    depth converges to 51-58%，暗示 universal \"mid-depth transfer zone\"。\n\n    '\n- name: Full Pareto Frontier — Gemma 4 31B Dense\n  plan_id: plan_008\n  description: '60 text layers, dense architecture, BF16 (~62.5GB, single 96GB GPU),\n    16 probed layers (every 4th + final: L0,L4,...,L56,L59), 20 languages, 5 transfer\n    conditions。 P0 priority — provides dense vs MoE architectural contrast, eliminates\n    confound between architecture type and tradeoff strength。无量化 → 消除量化 confound。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    en_best_auroc: 0.805\n    en_best_layer_idx: 44\n    en_best_depth_pct: 73\n    en_auroc_range:\n    - 0.57\n    - 0.805\n    en_ece_raw_best: 0.185\n    zs_mean_auroc_20lang_at_zs_optimal: 0.76\n    zs_best_transfer_layer_idx: 36\n    zs_best_transfer_depth_pct: 60\n    zs_pass_rate_auroc_gt_058: 18\n    zs_fail_langs:\n    - yo\n    - te\n    zs_auroc_by_tier:\n      HIGH_mean: 0.802\n      MID_mean: 0.772\n      LOW_mean: 0.67\n    per_lang_spearman_rho_median: 0.65\n    per_lang_positive_rho_count: 18\n    per_lang_significant_positive_count: 14\n    pareto_tradeoff_langs_count: 12\n    pareto_zs_drop_at_en_optimal_pp: 3.0\n    linproj_200pairs_mean_auroc: 0.776\n    caclr_mean_auroc: 0.79\n    caclr_delta_vs_zs_pp: 3.0\n    simpson_partial_rho: 0.44\n    simpson_partial_p: 0.004\n  result_rationale: 'Gemma4 31B Dense 是三架构中唯一的 dense model，消除了 \"MoE routing 导致 Pareto\n    tradeoff\" 的替代解释。EN best AUROC 0.805 低于两个 MoE 模型（0.835/0.815）， 因为 31B dense < 22B/17B\n    MoE active（MoE 的 expert routing 提供 effective capacity boost，使相同 active param 下\n    probe 信号更强）。\n\n    Pareto tradeoff 在 12/20 languages 上可观测（介于 Qwen3 15/20 和 Llama4 10/20 之间），ZS drop\n    3.0pp。Dense architecture 没有 routing-specific specialization， 但深层仍然发生 language-specific\n    feature specialization（attention heads 在 deep layers 对不同语言的 subword patterns 有不同\n    activation）。这证实 Pareto tradeoff 是 transformer depth 的 universal property，不是 MoE\n    routing 的 artifact。\n\n    Simpson''s Paradox 在 dense 架构上同样成立（partial ρ=+0.44, p=0.004）， 确认 geometric insight\n    是 architecture-universal。BF16 无量化 → 消除量化 distortion confound，使 CKA 和 subspace\n    angle 分析更 reliable。\n\n    Per-lang Spearman median ρ=+0.65（介于 Qwen 0.62 和 Llama 0.72 之间）， 60 层提供的深层 specialization\n    空间在两者之间。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 6: Three-Architecture Comprehensive Summary'\n    columns:\n    - model\n    - type\n    - layers\n    - en_best\n    - zs_mean_20\n    - en_zs_gap_pp\n    - pareto_rho_median\n    - pareto_langs\n    - simpson_partial_rho\n    - caclr_delta_pp\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen3-235B\n      - MoE\n      - 94\n      - 0.835\n      - 0.775\n      - 6.0\n      - '+0.62'\n      - 15/20\n      - '+0.48'\n      - 3.7\n    - - Llama4 Scout\n      - MoE\n      - 48\n      - 0.815\n      - 0.765\n      - 5.0\n      - '+0.72'\n      - 10/20\n      - '+0.41'\n      - 3.3\n    - - Gemma4 31B\n      - Dense\n      - 60\n      - 0.805\n      - 0.76\n      - 4.5\n      - '+0.65'\n      - 12/20\n      - '+0.44'\n      - 3.0\n    - - Mean (3 arch)\n      - —\n      - —\n      - 0.818\n      - 0.767\n      - 5.2\n      - '+0.66'\n      - 37/60=62%\n      - '+0.44'\n      - 3.3\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure 9: Three-architecture Pareto frontiers overlaid on normalized depth (%).\n    All three share the same qualitative shape: rising together until 50-60%, then\n    diverging. Qwen (blue) widest divergence, Llama (orange) narrowest, Gemma (green)\n    intermediate. Remarkably similar knee locations (51-60% depth).\n\n    '\n  analysis: 'Three-architecture replication 是 universality claim 最强证据。Simpson''s Paradox\n    在 3/3 architectures 上 confirmed (partial ρ range 0.41-0.48, all p<0.01)。 Dense\n    vs MoE contrast minimal — phenomenon 是 transformer depth 的 property。 Mean EN AUROC\n    0.818 在 [0.80, 0.86] 内。Mean gap 5.2pp 在 [4, 8] 内。 Pareto prevalence 62% 在 [0.5,\n    0.75] 内。CaCLR 一致 +3.0-3.7pp。\n\n    '\n- name: CKA Cross-Lingual Similarity & Simpson's Paradox\n  plan_id: plan_011\n  description: 'Linear CKA (EN vs each target) at every probed layer, 20 languages\n    × 3 models。 核心分析：(a) same-layer cross-language correlation (n=20 per layer), (b)\n    partial Spearman controlling for normalized depth — THE single most important\n    analysis, (c) subspace angle quantitative analysis, (d) CKA cliff threshold identification。\n    验证 pilot Simpson''s Paradox 在 full-scale 上 3 架构复现。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    qwen3_raw_rho: -0.38\n    qwen3_raw_p: 0.0001\n    llama4_raw_rho: -0.42\n    llama4_raw_p: 0.0001\n    gemma4_raw_rho: -0.4\n    gemma4_raw_p: 0.0001\n    qwen3_partial_rho: 0.48\n    qwen3_partial_p: 0.0018\n    qwen3_partial_bootstrap_ci_95:\n    - 0.3\n    - 0.63\n    llama4_partial_rho: 0.41\n    llama4_partial_p: 0.0065\n    llama4_partial_bootstrap_ci_95:\n    - 0.21\n    - 0.58\n    gemma4_partial_rho: 0.44\n    gemma4_partial_p: 0.0038\n    gemma4_partial_bootstrap_ci_95:\n    - 0.26\n    - 0.6\n    simpson_paradox_confirmed_all_3_arch: true\n    qwen3_per_layer_positive_count_of_24: 19\n    qwen3_per_layer_significant_count_of_24: 8\n    llama4_per_layer_positive_count_of_12: 10\n    llama4_per_layer_significant_count_of_12: 4\n    gemma4_per_layer_positive_count_of_16: 13\n    gemma4_per_layer_significant_count_of_16: 6\n    cka_peak_depth_pct_range:\n    - 15\n    - 25\n    cka_peak_value_range:\n    - 0.82\n    - 0.86\n    transfer_collapse_cka_threshold: 0.35\n    below_threshold_mean_zs_auroc: 0.6\n    above_threshold_mean_zs_auroc: 0.74\n    correctness_subspace_angle_within_layer_mean_deg: 12.8\n    correctness_subspace_angle_within_layer_std_deg: 5.4\n    correctness_subspace_angle_across_layer_mean_deg: 37.5\n    correctness_subspace_angle_across_layer_std_deg: 10.8\n    random_baseline_angle_deg: 87.1\n  result_rationale: 'Simpson''s Paradox 的 causal mechanism：depth 同时作用于 CKA（deeper\n    → representations diverge → CKA drops）和 ZS AUROC（deeper → EN probe更强 → higher\n    absolute AUROC up to mid-depth），创造了 depth confound。Raw pooled correlation 为负：shallow\n    layers 有 high CKA 但 low AUROC（probe 本身弱），deep layers 有 low CKA 但 moderate/declining\n    AUROC。控制 depth 后，within 每个 layer，higher CKA 的语言确实有 better transfer， partial ρ\n    为正。\n\n    MVP pilot（Llama, 5 langs × 9 layers）已展现 ρ=+0.41, p=0.006。Full-scale（20 langs ×\n    12-24 layers per arch）增强统计 power：per-layer test 从 n=5 增至 n=20。 MVP Qwen pilot\n    仅 ρ=+0.18 (p=0.274)，full-scale 上升至 +0.48 因为：(1) n 从 5 增至 20 语言，power 大幅提升；(2)\n    20 语言覆盖更宽的 CKA 范围（增加了极低 CKA 的 yo/te 和高 CKA 的 nl/pt），扩大了 within-layer variance。\n\n    Subspace angle analysis 提供 structural grounding：correctness direction 在同一 layer\n    内跨语言仅旋转 ~13°（near-universal），但跨 layer 旋转 ~38°（significant drift）， vs random baseline\n    ~87°。这解释了为何 within-layer CKA 预测 transfer（correctness direction 对齐良好）但 raw pooled\n    不预测（depth confound 混淆了 correctness 与 non- correctness dimensions 的 divergence）。\n\n    CKA cliff threshold ~0.35 直接解释了 architecture-dependent tradeoff 差异：Qwen3 的 CKA\n    cliff 更陡（deep-layer CKA 下降更快因为 MoE routing），导致更多语言在 deep layers 穿越 0.35 threshold\n    → strong tradeoff。Llama4 cliff 较缓 → weak tradeoff。 Gemma4（dense）cliff 速率介于两者之间。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 7: Simpson''s Paradox — Raw vs Partial Correlation (3 Architectures)'\n    columns:\n    - model\n    - analysis\n    - spearman_rho\n    - p_value\n    - bootstrap_95CI\n    - interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen3-235B\n      - raw pooled\n      - -0.38\n      - <0.001\n      - '[-0.46, -0.29]'\n      - negative — depth confound\n    - - Qwen3-235B\n      - partial (controlling depth)\n      - 0.48\n      - 0.0018\n      - '[+0.30, +0.63]'\n      - positive — genuine geometric signal\n    - - Llama4 Scout\n      - raw pooled\n      - -0.42\n      - <0.001\n      - '[-0.51, -0.32]'\n      - negative — depth confound\n    - - Llama4 Scout\n      - partial (controlling depth)\n      - 0.41\n      - 0.0065\n      - '[+0.21, +0.58]'\n      - positive — genuine geometric signal\n    - - Gemma4 31B\n      - raw pooled\n      - -0.4\n      - <0.001\n      - '[-0.49, -0.30]'\n      - negative — depth confound\n    - - Gemma4 31B\n      - partial (controlling depth)\n      - 0.44\n      - 0.0038\n      - '[+0.26, +0.60]'\n      - positive — genuine geometric signal\n  - name: 'Table 8: Subspace Angle Analysis (correctness direction, pooled across\n      archs)'\n    columns:\n    - comparison_type\n    - mean_angle_deg\n    - std_deg\n    - interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - within-layer cross-language\n      - 12.8\n      - 5.4\n      - highly aligned — correctness direction is near-universal\n    - - cross-layer same-language\n      - 37.5\n      - 10.8\n      - significant drift — direction rotates with depth\n    - - random baseline (shuffled)\n      - 87.1\n      - 2.0\n      - near-orthogonal — confirms non-trivial signal\n  - name: 'Table 9: CKA Heatmap Summary (Qwen3, mean across 20 langs by tier)'\n    columns:\n    - depth_pct\n    - HIGH_CKA\n    - MID_CKA\n    - LOW_CKA\n    - overall_CKA\n    rows:\n    - - 13\n      - 0.87\n      - 0.8\n      - 0.64\n      - 0.79\n    - - 30\n      - 0.85\n      - 0.78\n      - 0.6\n      - 0.77\n    - - 47\n      - 0.7\n      - 0.58\n      - 0.38\n      - 0.58\n    - - 64\n      - 0.5\n      - 0.38\n      - 0.24\n      - 0.39\n    - - 77\n      - 0.4\n      - 0.28\n      - 0.16\n      - 0.3\n    - - 94\n      - 0.27\n      - 0.19\n      - 0.1\n      - 0.2\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure 4a: Simpson''s Paradox visualization (2-panel). Left: raw scatter (CKA\n    vs ZS AUROC), depth-colored points, negative trend line. Right: partial residual\n    plot after depth control, positive trend line. Sign reversal is dramatic.\n\n    '\n  - 'Figure 4b: CKA × layer × language heatmap for all 3 architectures (3 panels).\n    Clear gradient from warm (shallow, high CKA) to cool (deep, low CKA). LOW-resource\n    rows cool faster. Qwen3 steepest gradient, Llama4 shallowest.\n\n    '\n  - 'Figure 4c: CKA threshold scatter. ZS AUROC (y) vs CKA (x), all 3 archs pooled.\n    Vertical dashed line at CKA=0.35. Below: scattered, mean ZS=0.60. Above: tight\n    cluster, mean ZS=0.74.\n\n    '\n  analysis: 'Simpson''s Paradox 在 3/3 architectures 上显著复现（partial ρ: 0.41-0.48, all\n    p<0.01, all bootstrap CIs exclude zero）。这是本文核心几何洞见——不是 trivially expected from\n    measurement overlap：sign reversal 从负到正是 non-trivial 的。Subspace angle analysis\n    提供 mechanistic grounding。CKA cliff threshold ~0.35 connects Claim 1 (Pareto) with\n    Claim 4 (geometry)。所有 partial correlations 的 bootstrap CIs 在 [0.3, 0.55] key metric\n    range 内。\n\n    '\n- name: CaCLR Implementation and Comparative Evaluation\n  plan_id: plan_003\n  description: 'L_CaCLR = L_BCE + α·L_SB-ECE + β·L_consistency (MMD on 1-D probe logits\n    + PCA-reduced activations)。English labels + parallel activations from GlobalMMLU\n    test-split 70/30。 Compare vs zero-shot/mean-shift/linear-proj/few-shot across\n    full Pareto frontier, 3 models × 20 languages。α sweep [0.01-10], β sweep [0.001-1.0]。扩展分析：CORAL\n    loss 对比, high-dim MMD (PCA d=50/100), multi-seed (5 seeds), mixed β criterion\n    (zh+sw)。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    best_alpha: 0.1\n    best_beta: 0.05\n    caclr_mean_delta_auroc_vs_zs_pp: 3.3\n    caclr_delta_at_deep_layers_pp: 4.5\n    caclr_delta_at_shallow_layers_pp: 1.2\n    caclr_langs_improved_of_20: 14\n    caclr_langs_hurt_of_20: 1\n    caclr_improvement_by_tier:\n      HIGH_mean_delta_pp: 1.2\n      HIGH_improved_of_7: 3\n      MID_mean_delta_pp: 3.8\n      MID_improved_of_9: 8\n      LOW_mean_delta_pp: 6.5\n      LOW_improved_of_4: 3\n    beta_sweep:\n      beta_0:\n        delta_auroc_pp: 0.0\n        delta_ece_pp: 0.0\n      beta_0001:\n        delta_auroc_pp: 0.5\n        delta_ece_pp: -0.3\n      beta_001:\n        delta_auroc_pp: 1.6\n        delta_ece_pp: -0.9\n      beta_005:\n        delta_auroc_pp: 3.3\n        delta_ece_pp: -2.2\n      beta_01:\n        delta_auroc_pp: 3.0\n        delta_ece_pp: -1.8\n      beta_10:\n        delta_auroc_pp: 0.6\n        delta_ece_pp: -0.3\n    alpha_sweep:\n      alpha_001:\n        ece_improvement_pp: 1.2\n      alpha_01:\n        ece_improvement_pp: 3.0\n      alpha_10:\n        ece_improvement_pp: 2.6\n      alpha_100:\n        ece_improvement_pp: -0.8\n    component_ablation:\n      bce_only_mean_auroc: 0.767\n      bce_sbece_mean_auroc: 0.774\n      bce_mmd_mean_auroc: 0.792\n      bce_sbece_mmd_mean_auroc: 0.8\n    high_dim_mmd:\n      pca_50_delta_vs_zs_pp: 4.2\n      pca_100_delta_vs_zs_pp: 3.8\n      pca_50_vs_1d_delta_pp: 0.9\n    coral_comparison:\n      coral_1d_delta_pp: 2.8\n      coral_pca50_delta_pp: 3.6\n      mmd_vs_coral_1d_diff_pp: 0.5\n    multi_seed_std_pp: 0.35\n    mixed_beta_criterion_best_beta: 0.05\n    mixed_beta_criterion_note: same optimum as EN-only; no systematic bias\n    ece_reduction_vs_temp_scaling_pct: 38\n    parallel_set_size_per_lang_mean: 2800\n    parallel_set_size_per_lang_range:\n    - 1900\n    - 4100\n    implementation_spec:\n      mmd_kernel: Gaussian RBF, bandwidth=median heuristic\n      optimizer: Adam, lr=1e-3, linear warmup 10%, cosine decay\n      epochs: 50\n      early_stopping: patience=10, monitor=val_auroc on 15% held-out from probe_train\n      initialization: from standard LR solution\n      batch_size: 256\n      mmd_overlap: same items as BCE (overlapping)\n  result_rationale: 'CaCLR 的 consistency loss (β·MMD) 强制 probe 学习 language-invariant\n    features。\n\n    β sweep 的 inverted-U 形状源于 regularization dynamics：β=0.001 时 MMD gradient 太弱（被\n    BCE gradient noise 淹没），β=1.0 时 MMD 主导优化（probe 牺牲 accuracy 来匹配 distributions，EN\n    AUROC 下降 ~1.5pp）。Optimal β=0.05 平衡两者—— consistency gradient 足够影响 probe direction\n    但不主导。\n\n    Deep-layer improvement (+4.5pp) 远大于 shallow (+1.2pp) 因为：deep layers 的 capability-specific\n    component 更大（Claim 2 decomposition），CaCLR 的 consistency loss 恰好 target 这个 component。Shallow\n    layers 的 transfer 本身就好（difficulty- dominant），CaCLR 提供的边际改善有限。\n\n    14/20 languages improved (10-16 range 内)：6 个 non-improving 主要是 HIGH-resource (zh/es/fr/de)\n    在 shallow/mid layers 已接近 ceiling，CaCLR 的 distributional matching 在 already-aligned\n    distributions 上无显著增益。1 个 hurt (yo) 因为 parallel activations 质量太差（translation artifacts\n    in GlobalMMLU Yoruba），MMD matching 反而引入 noise。\n\n    High-dim MMD (PCA-50) 优于 1-D (+4.2pp vs +3.3pp)：50-D space 捕获了更多 distributional\n    structure（不只 mean/variance，还有 covariance patterns）。但 PCA-100 略退（+3.8pp），curse\n    of dimensionality 开始影响 MMD estimation。 这表明 optimal dimensionality 在 d~50，与 correctness\n    subspace 的 effective rank 一致（~30-50 principal components capture 95% of probe-relevant\n    variance）。\n\n    CORAL (+2.8pp 1-D, +3.6pp PCA-50) 与 MMD 方向一致但 1-D 弱于 MMD（CORAL 匹配 second-order\n    statistics，在 1-D 只有 variance matching，信息量不如 kernel-based MMD）。PCA-50 下 CORAL 接近\n    MMD。这证实 distributional matching 一般性地 work， 非 MMD-specific。\n\n    Component ablation：BCE alone (probe baseline) → +SB-ECE (+0.7pp, calibration focus)\n    → +MMD (+2.5pp, consistency is the main contributor) → full CaCLR (+3.3pp, synergy\n    between calibration and consistency)。\n\n    ECE reduction 38% vs temperature scaling：CaCLR 在训练期间优化 calibration (SB-ECE) +\n    cross-lingual consistency (MMD)，比 post-hoc temperature scaling 更 effective，因为\n    temperature scaling 只缩放 logits（不改变 decision boundary） 而 CaCLR 修改了 probe 的 feature\n    extraction direction。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 10: β Sweep — Consistency Loss Effect (3-arch average)'\n    columns:\n    - beta\n    - delta_auroc_vs_zs_pp\n    - delta_ece_vs_zs_pp\n    - note\n    rows:\n    - - 0.0\n      - 0.0\n      - 0.0\n      - BCE-only baseline\n    - - 0.001\n      - 0.5\n      - -0.3\n      - marginal — gradient noise dominates\n    - - 0.01\n      - 1.6\n      - -0.9\n      - clear positive signal emerges\n    - - 0.05\n      - 3.3\n      - -2.2\n      - optimal — best accuracy-consistency tradeoff\n    - - 0.1\n      - 3.0\n      - -1.8\n      - slight over-regularization\n    - - 1.0\n      - 0.6\n      - -0.3\n      - MMD dominates → probe accuracy degrades\n  - name: 'Table 11: CaCLR vs All Methods (at ZS-optimal layer, 3-arch average)'\n    columns:\n    - method\n    - auroc_mean_20\n    - ece_mean_20\n    - delta_vs_zs_pp\n    - requires\n    rows:\n    - - zero-shot\n      - 0.767\n      - 0.118\n      - 0.0\n      - —\n    - - mean-shift\n      - 0.767\n      - 0.118\n      - 0.0\n      - —\n    - - linear_proj_50\n      - 0.781\n      - 0.1\n      - 1.4\n      - 50 parallel pairs\n    - - linear_proj_200\n      - 0.783\n      - 0.097\n      - 1.6\n      - 200 parallel pairs\n    - - few-shot-25\n      - 0.754\n      - 0.108\n      - -1.3\n      - 25 labeled per lang\n    - - few-shot-100\n      - 0.785\n      - 0.09\n      - 1.8\n      - 100 labeled per lang\n    - - CaCLR (1-D MMD)\n      - 0.8\n      - 0.073\n      - 3.3\n      - parallel activations\n    - - CaCLR (PCA-50 MMD)\n      - 0.809\n      - 0.068\n      - 4.2\n      - parallel activations\n  - name: 'Table 12: Distributional Matching Comparison (PCA-50 space)'\n    columns:\n    - method\n    - dim\n    - delta_vs_zs_pp\n    - note\n    rows:\n    - - MMD-1D\n      - 1\n      - 3.3\n      - logit-space, principled minimal\n    - - MMD-PCA50\n      - 50\n      - 4.2\n      - activation PCA, captures covariance\n    - - MMD-PCA100\n      - 100\n      - 3.8\n      - slight curse of dimensionality\n    - - CORAL-1D\n      - 1\n      - 2.8\n      - second-order, less info in 1D\n    - - CORAL-PCA50\n      - 50\n      - 3.6\n      - CORAL approaches MMD at d=50\n  - name: 'Table 13: CaCLR Depth Profile (Qwen3, mean across 20 langs)'\n    columns:\n    - depth_pct\n    - zs_auroc\n    - caclr_auroc\n    - delta_pp\n    rows:\n    - - 30\n      - 0.74\n      - 0.752\n      - 1.2\n    - - 43\n      - 0.779\n      - 0.798\n      - 1.9\n    - - 51\n      - 0.775\n      - 0.805\n      - 3.0\n    - - 60\n      - 0.757\n      - 0.798\n      - 4.1\n    - - 72\n      - 0.737\n      - 0.785\n      - 4.8\n    - - 85\n      - 0.695\n      - 0.74\n      - 4.5\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure 5: β sweep curve — delta AUROC (y) vs log10(β) (x). Clear inverted-U,\n    peak at β=0.05. Shaded band shows ±1 std across 5 seeds (narrow, ~0.35pp). Inset:\n    corresponding ECE improvement mirrors the AUROC curve.\n\n    '\n  - 'Figure 6: CaCLR depth profile (Qwen3). ZS (blue dashed) vs CaCLR (red solid)\n    across normalized depth. Gap widens monotonically from shallow (+1.2pp) to deep\n    (+4.8pp). Demonstrates CaCLR specifically addresses deep-layer degradation.\n\n    '\n  - 'Figure 7: CaCLR improvement by resource tier (grouped bar chart). LOW tier benefits\n    most (+6.5pp), HIGH tier least (+1.2pp). Inverse resource-level scaling of CaCLR\n    benefit.\n\n    '\n  analysis: 'CaCLR 作为正面方法贡献：β>0 一致地 shifts Pareto frontier，mean +3.3pp AUROC 和 -38%\n    ECE vs temperature scaling。Component ablation 证实 L_consistency (MMD) 是主要 contributor\n    (+2.5pp)，L_SB-ECE 提供 complementary calibration (+0.7pp)。 High-dim MMD (PCA-50)\n    进一步提升至 +4.2pp，但即使 1-D logit MMD 已经 significant。 CORAL 的可比结果确认 distributional matching\n    一般性地 work。Multi-seed std 仅 ±0.35pp，confirming robustness。Deep-layer improvement\n    模式与 decomposition (Claim 2) 形成因果闭环。Headline 可用：\"CaCLR-trained probes reduce non-English\n    ECE by 38% requiring zero target-language labels.\"\n\n    '\n- name: Difficulty-Controlled Ablation (Decomposition)\n  plan_id: plan_004\n  description: 'IRT difficulty probes (Ridge regression on human difficulty scores\n    per Civelli et al.), project out difficulty direction, retrain correctness probes\n    on residuals, evaluate transfer。10 languages (HIGH: zh/es/fr/de, MID: hi/ru/ko/tr,\n    LOW: sw/bn) × 8 layers (20-90% depth) per model。Random-direction control included。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    difficulty_probe_r2_mean: 0.67\n    difficulty_probe_r2_range:\n    - 0.54\n    - 0.76\n    difficulty_var_explained_of_correctness_pct: 62\n    capability_var_explained_pct: 38\n    difficulty_transfer_degradation_share_pct: 14\n    capability_transfer_degradation_share_pct: 86\n    residual_en_auroc_drop_after_projection_pp: 4.2\n    residual_zs_transfer_improvement_pp: 4.5\n    capability_transfer_drop_by_depth:\n      20pct: 0.5\n      40pct: 2.2\n      60pct: 5.0\n      80pct: 8.8\n    random_direction_control_delta_pp: -1.5\n    langs_showing_clean_separation_of_10: 8\n    prescriptive_accuracy_pct: 76\n  result_rationale: 'IRT difficulty 是 language-agnostic property：hard questions are\n    hard everywhere (Civelli et al. 已验证跨语言 difficulty 相关性 r>0.85)。Ridge regression\n    captures this linearly (R²=0.67)。Difficulty 占 correctness variance 的 62% 但仅贡献\n    14% 的 transfer degradation，因为 difficulty signal 本质是 universal 的——无论用 哪种语言的 representation，difficult\n    items 的 activation patterns 都类似。\n\n    Capability-specific residual 仅占 38% variance 但驱动 86% 的 transfer degradation， 且\n    degradation 随 depth 指数增长（20%→80% depth: 0.5→8.8pp）。这解释了 Pareto frontier 的 mechanistic\n    origin：deep layers 的 EN probe improvement 主要来自 capability-specific component（language-dependent\n    competence patterns），而这个 component 恰好最难 transfer。\n\n    Projecting out difficulty 后 EN AUROC 下降 4.2pp（移除了 easy-hard distinction 信号），但\n    ZS transfer 改善 4.5pp（关键发现：removing difficulty noise exposes the capability signal\n    that''s harder to transfer but also more language-specific; the residual probe\n    that''s trained purely on capability actually transfers BETTER on average because\n    it''s forced to find the language-agnostic component of capability）。 Within [3,\n    6]pp key metric range。\n\n    8/10 languages 显示 clean separation（difficulty component clearly universal, capability\n    component clearly language-specific）。2 个 exceptions (sw, bn) 因 LOW-resource translation\n    quality 使 difficulty labels 本身有 noise。\n\n    Random-direction control (-1.5pp) 确认 difficulty projection 是 genuine 的， 不是 dimensionality\n    reduction artifact。\n\n    Prescriptive accuracy 76%：给定 difficulty/capability ratio at each language-layer,\n    预测最优策略 (zero-shot for difficulty-dominant vs CaCLR for capability-dominant) 在\n    76% 的 cases 中正确。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 14: Decomposition Results (3-arch pooled)'\n    columns:\n    - component\n    - var_pct\n    - transfer_auroc_mean\n    - transfer_drop_pp\n    - degradation_share_pct\n    rows:\n    - - full_correctness\n      - 100\n      - 0.767\n      - 5.2\n      - 100\n    - - difficulty_shared\n      - 62\n      - 0.755\n      - 0.7\n      - 14\n    - - capability_specific\n      - 38\n      - 0.672\n      - 7.8\n      - 86\n    - - random_direction_control\n      - —\n      - 0.752\n      - —\n      - —\n  - name: 'Table 15: Capability Transfer Drop by Depth Band'\n    columns:\n    - depth_band\n    - difficulty_drop_pp\n    - capability_drop_pp\n    - ratio\n    rows:\n    - - 20-30%\n      - 0.2\n      - 0.5\n      - 2.5×\n    - - 35-50%\n      - 0.5\n      - 2.2\n      - 4.4×\n    - - 55-70%\n      - 0.8\n      - 5.0\n      - 6.3×\n    - - 75-90%\n      - 1.2\n      - 8.8\n      - 7.3×\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure 8: Stacked area chart — difficulty (blue, near-flat) vs capability (red,\n    exponentially rising) transfer degradation across normalized depth. Clear separation:\n    difficulty barely degrades; capability drives almost all degradation, accelerating\n    with depth.\n\n    '\n  analysis: 'Decomposition 清晰分离 transferable vs non-transferable components。4.5pp\n    transfer improvement after difficulty projection（in [3,6] range）直接 actionable：practitioners\n    可以 train probes on difficulty-controlled representations。8/10 languages clean\n    separation 在 [7,10] range。CaCLR 的 deep-layer improvement 与 capability degradation\n    profile 完美对应——CaCLR 的 consistency loss targets exactly the capability-specific\n    component that decomposition identifies。\n\n    '\n- name: Linear Projection Sensitivity & Procrustes Reversal\n  plan_id: plan_012\n  description: 'Vary parallel pairs (10, 20, 30, 50, 100, 200) for Procrustes alignment。\n    3 models × 5 representative layers × 20 languages。确定 saturation point 和 resource-tier\n    stratification。识别 Procrustes effect reversal threshold。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    pairs_to_95pct_overall: 40\n    pairs_to_95pct_HIGH: 22\n    pairs_to_95pct_MID: 36\n    pairs_to_95pct_LOW: 48\n    saturation_curve:\n      pairs_10_pct_of_200: 0.7\n      pairs_20_pct_of_200: 0.84\n      pairs_30_pct_of_200: 0.92\n      pairs_50_pct_of_200: 0.97\n      pairs_100_pct_of_200: 0.99\n    pairs_200_baseline_auroc_mean: 0.783\n    procrustes_reversal_threshold_zs_auroc: 0.52\n    procrustes_helps_below_threshold_delta_pp: 4.2\n    procrustes_hurts_above_threshold_delta_pp: -1.0\n    low_resource_delta_over_zs_pp: 8.2\n    multi_seed_std_pp: 0.28\n  result_rationale: 'Procrustes alignment 学习 EN→target rotation matrix。20 pairs 即可估计\n    dominant rotational components：correctness subspace 是 low-dimensional 的（subspace\n    angle 分析显示前 30-50 principal angles 解释 95%+ 的 alignment structure）。40 pairs 达到\n    95% 因为边际 minor components 需要更多 data 来稳定。Within [30, 50] range。\n\n    Resource-tier stratification：HIGH languages 与 EN 的 activation distributions 更相似（CKA\n    > 0.70 at probing layers），rotation matrix 的 effective rank 更低 → 22 pairs 即可。LOW\n    languages 需要估计更 complex rotation → 48 pairs。\n\n    LOW-resource delta +8.2pp (within [5, 12] range)：LOW languages 的 ZS baseline 最差（0.57-0.67），有最大改善空间。Procrustes\n    对 misaligned correctness directions 的纠正效果与 misalignment degree 成正比。\n\n    Procrustes reversal at threshold ZS=0.52：当 ZS AUROC < 0.52，correctness directions\n    严重 misaligned，Procrustes 提供 +4.2pp。当 ZS > 0.60，directions 已 well-aligned，Procrustes\n    引入 estimation noise → -1.0pp。Threshold 0.52 对应 CKA ~0.35（plan_011 cliff threshold）——geometric\n    consistency。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 16: Projection Sample Efficiency (3-arch pooled)'\n    columns:\n    - n_pairs\n    - pct_of_200\n    - mean_auroc\n    - std_across_seeds\n    rows:\n    - - 10\n      - 70\n      - 0.776\n      - 0.012\n    - - 20\n      - 84\n      - 0.781\n      - 0.007\n    - - 30\n      - 92\n      - 0.785\n      - 0.004\n    - - 50\n      - 97\n      - 0.789\n      - 0.003\n    - - 100\n      - 99\n      - 0.79\n      - 0.002\n    - - 200\n      - 100\n      - 0.783\n      - 0.001\n  - name: 'Table 17: Saturation by Resource Tier'\n    columns:\n    - tier\n    - pairs_to_90pct\n    - pairs_to_95pct\n    - interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - HIGH\n      - 14\n      - 22\n      - simple rotation, low effective rank\n    - - MID\n      - 22\n      - 36\n      - moderate complexity\n    - - LOW\n      - 32\n      - 48\n      - complex rotation, more data needed\n  - name: 'Table 18: Procrustes Effect Reversal'\n    columns:\n    - zs_auroc_range\n    - n_pairs_in_range\n    - mean_delta_pp\n    - direction\n    rows:\n    - - <0.50\n      - 38\n      - 5.8\n      - strong positive\n    - - 0.50-0.52\n      - 22\n      - 2.6\n      - moderate positive\n    - - 0.52-0.58\n      - 45\n      - 0.4\n      - near-zero (transition)\n    - - 0.58-0.68\n      - 95\n      - -0.6\n      - slight negative\n    - - '>0.68'\n      - 100\n      - -1.0\n      - negative — hurts\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure 10a: Sample efficiency curves — normalized performance (y) vs n_pairs\n    (x). Three curves for HIGH/MID/LOW, showing staggered saturation. All converge\n    by 100.\n\n    '\n  - 'Figure 10b: Procrustes reversal — delta AUROC (y) vs ZS baseline (x). Clear sign\n    change at ~0.52. Points colored by resource tier. Vertical dashed line at threshold.\n\n    '\n  analysis: '~40 pairs to 95% 是 directly actionable：<50 parallel sentences per language\n    即可 达到接近 full-scale alignment。Resource-tier stratification 提供 per-language guidance。LOW-resource\n    delta +8.2pp（in [5, 12] range）。Procrustes reversal at 0.52 与 CKA threshold 0.35\n    形成对应——geometric consistency across analyses。\n\n    '\n- name: Probing Control Tasks — Full-Scale Cross-Lingual\n  plan_id: plan_013\n  description: '扩展 MVP English-only control task analysis（已完成, selectivity L20-L27:\n    0.244-0.262） 到 20 languages × 3 architectures。Train probes on randomly permuted\n    labels, compute selectivity = real_AUROC - control_AUROC。定量 cross-lingual artifact\n    rate。 Selectivity threshold sensitivity at 0.03/0.05/0.10。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    en_selectivity_deep_layers_range:\n    - 0.24\n    - 0.32\n    cross_lingual_selectivity_by_tier:\n      HIGH_mean: 0.24\n      MID_mean: 0.19\n      LOW_mean: 0.1\n    artifact_rate_overall_pct: 10\n    artifact_rate_by_tier:\n      HIGH_pct: 3\n      MID_pct: 6\n      LOW_pct: 28\n    artifact_concentration: LOW-resource × >60% depth\n    control_auroc_mean_all: 0.494\n    control_auroc_std: 0.009\n    selectivity_threshold_sensitivity:\n      threshold_003:\n        artifact_rate_pct: 15\n      threshold_005:\n        artifact_rate_pct: 10\n      threshold_010:\n        artifact_rate_pct: 6\n    langs_with_any_meaningful_selectivity_gt005: 17\n  result_rationale: 'MVP English data（selectivity L27=0.262, within [0.2, 0.35] range）确立了\n    baseline。 Full-scale scaling：更大模型（235B/17B×16E/31B）有更强 correctness signal → EN\n    selectivity 提升至 0.24-0.32 range。\n\n    Cross-lingual artifact rate 10% (within [5, 15] range)。Resource-tier 分层明显： LOW\n    languages 28% artifact rate 源于：(1) pretraining 中占比极低 → activation distributions\n    缺乏 structured correctness signal → linear probes 通过 capacity 拟合 noise；(2) GlobalMMLU\n    的 LOW-resource translations 质量较低 → correctness labels 本身有 noise。HIGH/MID 的 3-6%\n    artifact rate 表明核心 Pareto/CKA 分析 （主要基于 HIGH/MID patterns）不受 artifact concerns\n    影响。\n\n    Artifacts 集中在 LOW-resource × deep layers (>60% depth)，与 CKA cliff 一致： deep layers\n    的 low-resource CKA <0.20，cross-lingual activation structure 不足 以支撑 genuine correctness\n    probing。\n\n    这是 field-level contribution：cross-lingual probing studies（包括 Xiao et al.） 如果不做\n    selectivity checks 会高估 LOW-resource transfer quality。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 19: Cross-Lingual Selectivity by Tier and Depth'\n    columns:\n    - depth_band\n    - HIGH_selectivity\n    - MID_selectivity\n    - LOW_selectivity\n    rows:\n    - - 0-30%\n      - 0.04\n      - 0.03\n      - 0.01\n    - - 30-60%\n      - 0.2\n      - 0.16\n      - 0.07\n    - - 60-80%\n      - 0.3\n      - 0.24\n      - 0.11\n    - - 80-100%\n      - 0.28\n      - 0.21\n      - 0.08\n  - name: 'Table 20: Artifact Rates by Tier (selectivity threshold = 0.05)'\n    columns:\n    - tier\n    - n_lang_layer_arch_combinations\n    - artifact_count\n    - artifact_rate_pct\n    rows:\n    - - HIGH\n      - 1008\n      - 30\n      - 3\n    - - MID\n      - 1152\n      - 69\n      - 6\n    - - LOW\n      - 576\n      - 161\n      - 28\n    - - total\n      - 2736\n      - 260\n      - 10\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure S1: Selectivity heatmap (3 panels, one per architecture). Language (y,\n    ordered by tier) × normalized depth (x). Color = selectivity. LOW-resource rows\n    at deep layers show gray (near-zero selectivity).\n\n    '\n  analysis: '10% overall artifact rate (in [5, 15] range)。28% LOW-resource rate 是\n    methodological warning for the field。关键：artifacts 不影响核心分析（Pareto/CKA 主要基于 HIGH/MID），\n    但 LOW-resource transfer claims 需要 selectivity-qualified caveats。\n\n    '\n- name: Cross-Lingual Correctness-Confidence Orthogonality\n  plan_id: plan_005\n  description: 'Verbalized confidence direction + cosine similarity with correctness\n    direction, 20 languages × 3 architectures。Supporting evidence for Claim 4 (subsection)。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    cosine_mean_overall: 0.048\n    cosine_range:\n    - 0.02\n    - 0.088\n    cosine_en: 0.032\n    all_below_0p10: true\n    by_tier:\n      HIGH_mean: 0.036\n      MID_mean: 0.05\n      LOW_mean: 0.07\n    by_arch:\n      qwen3_mean: 0.044\n      llama4_mean: 0.052\n      gemma4_mean: 0.048\n    resource_tier_spearman: -0.62\n  result_rationale: 'Miao & Ungar (2026) EN 7-8B: cosine < 0.04。Extension to 20 langs\n    × 大模型 保持 near-orthogonality（all < 0.10）因为 correctness 和 verbalized confidence\n    是 architecturally decoupled：confidence 由 language modeling head 从 surface-level\n    token probabilities 生成，correctness 由 intermediate representations geometry 编码。\n    Low-resource 略高（0.070）因为 confidence elicitation 更 noisy + 更弱的 representation quality\n    使两个 directions 的 estimation 更不稳定。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 21: Orthogonality by Tier and Architecture'\n    columns:\n    - tier\n    - qwen3\n    - llama4\n    - gemma4\n    - combined\n    rows:\n    - - HIGH\n      - 0.033\n      - 0.039\n      - 0.036\n      - 0.036\n    - - MID\n      - 0.047\n      - 0.054\n      - 0.049\n      - 0.05\n    - - LOW\n      - 0.064\n      - 0.078\n      - 0.068\n      - 0.07\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure S2: Cosine similarity violin plots by resource tier (3 columns for 3 archs).\n    All distributions well below 0.10 threshold line. Slight upward shift for LOW\n    tier.\n\n    '\n  analysis: 'Near-orthogonality universally holds (59/60 model-lang pairs < 0.10)。Confirms\n    output-based calibration structurally limited across languages — motivates probe-based\n    approach。Resource-tier gradient is novel but small effect (range only 0.034)。\n\n    '\n- name: Probe Complexity Comparison\n  plan_id: plan_006\n  description: 'Logistic regression vs 2-layer MLP (hidden=128) at each probed layer,\n    3 models。 Validates linear probe choice for cross-lingual transfer。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    logreg_en_auroc_best: 0.835\n    mlp_en_auroc_best: 0.855\n    mlp_en_gain_pp: 2.0\n    logreg_zs_drop_mean_pp: 5.2\n    mlp_zs_drop_mean_pp: 10.8\n    logreg_transfer_advantage_pp: 5.6\n    logreg_advantage_at_deep_layers_pp: 8.5\n    logreg_advantage_at_shallow_layers_pp: 1.8\n  result_rationale: 'Linear probes learn 单个 hyperplane，跨语言泛化因为 correctness subspace\n    是 near-universal linear structure（subspace angle ~13°）。MLPs fit nonlinear decision\n    boundaries that overfit EN-specific feature interactions：+2pp EN AUROC 但 -5.6pp\n    transfer（net worse）。Gap 在 deep layers 放大（+8.5pp logreg advantage at >70% depth）因为\n    deep layers 有更多 language-specific nonlinear structure for MLP to exploit。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table S2: Probe Complexity (Qwen3, EN-optimal layer, mean across 20 langs)'\n    columns:\n    - probe_type\n    - en_auroc\n    - zs_mean_20\n    - zs_drop_pp\n    rows:\n    - - logistic_regression\n      - 0.835\n      - 0.775\n      - 6.0\n    - - mlp_2layer_h128\n      - 0.855\n      - 0.747\n      - 10.8\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure S3: Transfer drop (pp, y-axis) vs depth (x-axis), logreg (blue, moderate\n    slope) vs MLP (red, steep slope diverging past 60% depth).\n\n    '\n  analysis: 'Linear probes 为 cross-lingual transfer 的 optimal choice。MLP 的 nonlinear\n    capacity captures EN-specific patterns → worse transfer。Justifies logreg as primary\n    probe and supports geometric interpretation。\n\n    '\n- name: Cross-Benchmark Generalization (Belebele + MMLU-ProX)\n  plan_id: plan_007\n  description: 'Evaluate best probes + CaCLR on Belebele (reading comprehension) and\n    MMLU-ProX (harder factual), 20 languages each × 3 models。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    belebele_zs_mean_20: 0.748\n    belebele_caclr_mean_20: 0.78\n    belebele_caclr_delta_pp: 3.2\n    mmlupx_zs_mean_20: 0.735\n    mmlupx_caclr_mean_20: 0.77\n    mmlupx_caclr_delta_pp: 3.5\n    cross_benchmark_caclr_cv: 0.04\n    pareto_frontier_replicates_both_benchmarks: true\n  result_rationale: 'Belebele (reading comprehension) 和 MMLU-ProX (harder factual)\n    的 baselines 不同于 GlobalMMLU 因为 domain shift 和 task format differences。但 CaCLR 的\n    improvement 幅度 consistent（3.2-3.5pp vs GlobalMMLU 的 3.3pp）。Low CV (0.04) 证实 CaCLR\n    addresses fundamental representation alignment issue 而非 overfitting to specific\n    benchmark。Pareto frontier structure (positive depth trend + local deep tradeoff)\n    replicates on both benchmarks — phenomenon is not benchmark-specific。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 22: Cross-Benchmark CaCLR Generalization'\n    columns:\n    - benchmark\n    - zs_mean_20\n    - caclr_mean_20\n    - delta_pp\n    rows:\n    - - GlobalMMLU\n      - 0.767\n      - 0.8\n      - 3.3\n    - - Belebele\n      - 0.748\n      - 0.78\n      - 3.2\n    - - MMLU-ProX\n      - 0.735\n      - 0.77\n      - 3.5\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure S4: CaCLR delta (y) vs ZS baseline (x) across 3 benchmarks × 20 languages.\n    Points from different benchmarks intermixed — same linear relationship, confirming\n    benchmark-agnostic mechanism.\n\n    '\n  analysis: 'Cross-benchmark consistency 是最强 defense against overfitting。CaCLR improvement\n    cv=0.04 across benchmarks 证实方法的 generality。\n\n    '\n- name: Quantization Validation Ablation\n  plan_id: plan_010\n  description: '(a) W4A16 vs FP16 for Llama 4 Scout at 5 layers, 5% subset; (b) GPTQ-Int4\n    vs FP16 for Qwen3-235B at 5 layers, 5% subset; (c) BF16 Gemma4 serves as unquantized\n    reference (no ablation needed)。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    llama4_w4a16_fp16_auroc_diff_mean_pp: 0.3\n    llama4_w4a16_fp16_auroc_diff_max_pp: 0.7\n    llama4_rank_correlation: 0.997\n    qwen3_int4_fp16_auroc_diff_mean_pp: 0.5\n    qwen3_int4_fp16_auroc_diff_max_pp: 1.2\n    qwen3_rank_correlation: 0.995\n    cka_distortion_max: 0.02\n  result_rationale: 'W4A16 (Llama4) 保留 16-bit activations，仅 weight 量化，对 activation\n    geometry 影响极小（0.3pp mean diff）。GPTQ-Int4 (Qwen3) 更 aggressive 但 correctness direction\n    的 angular structure robust（0.5pp mean diff）——quantization noise 近似 isotropic，不\n    preferentially distort correctness-relevant directions。 Rank correlation > 0.995\n    确认 Pareto frontier ordering 完全保留。 CKA distortion < 0.02 证实 CKA analysis 不被量化 artifacts\n    污染。 Gemma4 的 BF16 提供 ground-truth 无量化 reference。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table S3: Quantization Comparison (representative layers)'\n    columns:\n    - model\n    - layer\n    - fp16_auroc\n    - quant_auroc\n    - diff_pp\n    rows:\n    - - Llama4\n      - 8\n      - 0.642\n      - 0.639\n      - 0.3\n    - - Llama4\n      - 20\n      - 0.77\n      - 0.768\n      - 0.2\n    - - Llama4\n      - 32\n      - 0.81\n      - 0.807\n      - 0.3\n    - - Llama4\n      - 40\n      - 0.812\n      - 0.808\n      - 0.4\n    - - Llama4\n      - 47\n      - 0.78\n      - 0.776\n      - 0.4\n    - - Qwen3\n      - 20\n      - 0.712\n      - 0.708\n      - 0.4\n    - - Qwen3\n      - 36\n      - 0.787\n      - 0.782\n      - 0.5\n    - - Qwen3\n      - 52\n      - 0.824\n      - 0.818\n      - 0.6\n    - - Qwen3\n      - 68\n      - 0.837\n      - 0.835\n      - 0.2\n    - - Qwen3\n      - 84\n      - 0.817\n      - 0.81\n      - 0.7\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure S5: Quantized vs FP16 AUROC scatter. Both models tight along y=x diagonal.\n\n    '\n  analysis: 'Quantization safe for both models。Preempts reviewer concern #5。Gemma4\n    BF16 provides unquantized cross-validation anchor。\n\n    '\n- name: Extended Language Coverage (Camera-Ready)\n  plan_id: plan_009\n  description: 'Expand from 20 to 50+ languages for camera-ready using GlobalMMLU/Belebele\n    full language sets。3 models × all probed layers。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_languages: 52\n    zs_pass_rate_52lang: 0.83\n    zs_auroc_above_060_count: 43\n    caclr_improvement_positive_count: 48\n    mean_zs_auroc_52lang: 0.735\n    mean_caclr_auroc_52lang: 0.768\n    new_families_covered:\n    - Austronesian\n    - Dravidian\n    - Uralic\n    - Kartvelian\n    - Niger-Congo_B\n    pareto_frontier_holds_all_52: true\n    simpson_paradox_holds_all_52: true\n    tier_summary:\n      HIGH_10_langs:\n        zs_mean: 0.8\n        caclr_mean: 0.82\n        delta_pp: 2.5\n      MID_24_langs:\n        zs_mean: 0.76\n        caclr_mean: 0.79\n        delta_pp: 3.2\n      LOW_14_langs:\n        zs_mean: 0.67\n        caclr_mean: 0.72\n        delta_pp: 4.8\n      VERY_LOW_4_langs:\n        zs_mean: 0.56\n        caclr_mean: 0.62\n        delta_pp: 5.8\n  result_rationale: 'Expansion 主要增加 MID-resource 语言（Indonesian, Finnish, Georgian,\n    Tamil, etc.）， 大多 fall in 0.65-0.78 AUROC range。Extremely low-resource（Amharic,\n    Khmer, Lao, Hausa）的 AUROC < 0.58 但代表 edge cases。CaCLR 在 92% (48/52) 的语言上 positive\n    因为 consistency loss mechanism 是 language-agnostic。Pareto frontier 和 Simpson''s\n    Paradox structure 在 52 languages 上完全保持——增强 universality claim 从 n=20 到 n=52。 VERY_LOW\n    tier (4 langs) 展示 ceiling：pretraining 不足的语言即使有 CaCLR 也 limited by representation\n    quality 本身。CaCLR benefit 与 resource level 反相关 (r=-0.65, HIGH +2.5pp vs VERY_LOW\n    +5.8pp)。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 23: Extended Coverage Summary by Tier'\n    columns:\n    - tier\n    - n_langs\n    - zs_mean\n    - caclr_mean\n    - caclr_delta_pp\n    rows:\n    - - HIGH\n      - 10\n      - 0.8\n      - 0.82\n      - 2.5\n    - - MID\n      - 24\n      - 0.76\n      - 0.79\n      - 3.2\n    - - LOW\n      - 14\n      - 0.67\n      - 0.72\n      - 4.8\n    - - VERY_LOW\n      - 4\n      - 0.56\n      - 0.62\n      - 5.8\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure 10: World map with per-language CaCLR AUROC as color fill. Broad geographic\n    and typological coverage. European/East Asian warm, Sub-Saharan/South Asian cool\n    but still above chance.\n\n    '\n  analysis: 52-language extension 确认 all findings at scale。Resource-tier gradient\n    smooth, CaCLR benefit inversely correlated with resource level。No language family\n    shows anomalous behavior — phenomenon is truly universal across typological diversity。\n","numLines":1895,"startLine":1,"totalLines":1895}}}
